\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (13\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Nota quod Christus venit in mundum ut diues ad mendicos, medicus ad infirmos, liberator ad captiuos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... Parallelhs.: Innsbruck, UB,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Cod 374}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 , 2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (14\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Dominica prima\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Erunt signa in sole\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Lc 21,25). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Beatus enim Ieronimus, fratres karissimi, in annalibus Hebreorum invenit XV signa XV dierum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Wegweiser, S. \plain \f2\lang1024\fs22 232, weist die Predigt Jacobus de Voragine zu. Parallelhs.: P\u252 \'fcrglitz (K\u345 \'f8ivokl\u225 \'e1t), Krivokl\u225 \'e1tsk\u225 \'e1 Knihovny, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[1].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\lang1024\fs22\chcbpat17 Ms. I e 10}}\plain \f2\lang1024\fs22 , 49\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f2\lang1024\fs22 . Vgl. Rukopisy K\u345 \'f8ivokl\u225 \'e1tsk\u233 \'e9 Knihovny = Codices manu scripti Bibliothecae Castri K\u345 \'f8ivokl\u225 \'e1t. Soupis sest. Ji\u345 \'f8\u237 \'ed \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Pra\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 \u382 \'9e\u225 \'e1\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 k\plain \f2\lang1024\fs22 . Prag 1969 (Knihovna N\u225 \'e1rodn\u237 \'edho Muzea: Katalogy a invent\u225 \'e1\u345 \'f8e 10), S. 206. \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (16\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Dom. 2: Jacobus de Voragine, vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Repertorium 3, S. 222, Nr. 10 (T3). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (18\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Dom. 3: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Ego vox clamantis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Io 1,23). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Uerba ante dicta, dilectissimi, recipit beatus Johannes sacerdotibus et leuitis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (20\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Dom. 4: Jacobus de Voragine, vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Repertorium 3, S. 221, Nr. 2 (T1). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 6\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (22\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  In die Christi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b Conradus de Saxonia, vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Mohan\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Initia, S. 215; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Repertorium 1, S. 749, Nr. 25 (T6). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (24\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Venire. Nota quod dominus venit ad nos quadrupliciter videlicet in mundum tamquam minister humilis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... Distinctiones sermonum Amici; Themata sermonum. Basel: Nikolaus Kessler, 1495, f. LXX\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . GW 1617; BSB-Ink A-481. \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 8\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (25\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  In die Christi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Cantate domino canticum nouum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Ps 95,1; 97,1; 149,1). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Verba predicta, fratres karissimi, cantat hodie sancta mater ecclesia in missam diei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... Parallelhs.: Herzogenburg, StiftsB, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[2].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Ms 21}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , 191\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (27\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Ecce ewangelizo uobis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Lc 2,10). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Hodie, fratres karissimi, dicuntur uobis omnibus boni rumores\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... Parallelhss.: Hildesheim, DomB, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[3].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Hs 718}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , 118\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ; Uppsala, UB, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[4].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 C 19}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , 128\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 10\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (28\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Ecce video celos apertos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Act 7, 55). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Beatus Stephanus, fratres karissimi, appropinquans morti duo videt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... Vgl. Johannes Baptist \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Schne\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 yer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Sind in die Sermonessammlung des Robert de Sorbono Predigtskizzen Alberts des Gro\u223 \'dfen aufgenommen?, in: RThAM 34 (1967), S. 179-218, ebd. S. 197, Nr. 65. \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 11\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (30\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Amantissimus dominus habitabit confidenter\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Dt 33,12). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Tria sunt, fratres karissimi, que beatum Johannem ornant et decorant\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... Vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Sermonessammlung, S. 197, Nr. 69. \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 12\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (31\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  De innocentibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b Greculus, vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Repertorium 2, S. 240, Nr. 439 (S11). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 13\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (33\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Dominica infra octavam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b Conradus de Saxonia, vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Mohan\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Initia, S. 307; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Repertorium 1, S. 750, Nr. 40 (T7). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 14\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (35\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Circumcisio domini: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Vocatum est nomen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Lc 2,21). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  In sermone predicto, fratres karissimi, dictum est de circumcisione redemptoris et determinacione temporis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... \u196 \'c4hnlicher Wortlaut auch bei \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Sermonessammlung, S. 198, Nr. 76. \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 15\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (36\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  In epyphania\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Uidentes autem stellam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Mt 2,10). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  In verbis prenotatis, fratres karissimi, consideratur magna dei bonitas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 16\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (39\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) f4 post L: Johannes Contractus, vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Repertorium 3, S. 435, Nr. 28 (T18/4). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 17\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (41\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Penitenciam agite\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Mt 3,2). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Duo tanguntur hic, scilicet penitencie necessitas et eiusdem necessitas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  estote parati, quia qua hora non\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Lc 12,40)|| Textabbruch. Parallelhss.: Fritzlar, DB, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[5].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Ms 4}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , 149\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ; W\u252 \'fcrzburg, UB, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[6].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 M.ch.f. 174}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , 123\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . Vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Wegweiser, S. 406. \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 18\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (44\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  De epiphania\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b Cordulus, vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Repertorium 7, S. 605, Nr. 10 (T10). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 19\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (45\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Dominica I\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   post epiphaniam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Ecce pater tuus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Lc 2,48). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  In ewangelio predicto, fratres karissimi, tria docemur, quod dolore debemus amissione ipsum amissum cum sollicitudine quere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 20\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (46\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Dom. 2: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Nupcie facte sunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Io 2,1). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  In sermone predicto, fratres karissimi, denim est de carnalibus nupciis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 21\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (47\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Dom. 3: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Nolite esse prudentes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Rm 12,16). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  In ewangelio hodierno, fratres karissimi, agitur de leproso, quem dominus sanauit in corpore\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... Parallelhs.: W\u252 \'fcrzburg, UB, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[7].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 M.p.th.q. 58}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , 100\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . Vgl. Hans \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Thurn\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Die Handschriften des W\u252 \'fcrzburger Dominikanerkonvents in der Universit\u228 \'e4tsbibliothek W\u252 \'fcrzburg, in: W\u252 \'fcrzburger Di\u246 \'f6zesangeschichtsbl\u228 \'e4tter 29 (1967), S. 5-87, ebd. S. 40. \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 22\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (49\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Dom. 4: Jacobus de Voragine, vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Repertorium 3, S. 223, Nr. 26 (T14). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 23\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (50\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Dom. 5: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Simile est regno celorum homini qui seminauit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Mt 13,24). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  In uerbis prenotatis, fratres karissimi, tria nobis declarantur, scilicet dei beneficium, diabolicum maleficium et humanum exercicium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 24\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (51\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Dom. 6: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Simile est regnum celorum homini patrifamilias\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Mt 20,1). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Dominus noster Ihesus Christus, fratres karissimi, sepe ad turbas in parabolis loquebatur, ut boni et humiles intelligerentur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 25\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (53\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Dominica infra Quinquagesimam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Exurge quare obdormis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Ps 43,23). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Verba predicta, fratres karissimi, sunt inceptio misse et exclamat ea sancta mater ecclesia uoce lamentabili ad Christum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 26\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (54\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Dom. infra L: Siboto OP, vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Repertorium 5, S. 402, Nr. 30 (T18).}

