\pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  56\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  -71\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22     {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Sermones quadragesimales}}
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 (56\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rab\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Guilelmus Peraldus, vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Repertorium 2, S. 533, Nr. 3 (T1). \endash  (56\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  -71\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Sermones \u8222 \'84Quemadmodum\ldblquote : \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (56\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Cinis es et in cinere reuerteris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (vgl. Gn 3,19). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Quemadmodum homo pauper et ignobilis sublimatus in honorem non poterit lasciuire neque superbire\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (57\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Dic verbo et sanabitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Mt 8,8; Lc 7,7). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Quemadmodum rex verbo imperat, medicus sanat et magister informat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (59\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Intra in cubiculum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Mt 6,6). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Quemadmodum bonum consulit pater filio, vtile proponit medicus infirmo, opus exponit dominus suo operario\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (60\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Ascendes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (!, vielm.: ascendissent) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  in nauiculam et cessauit ventus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (vgl. Mt 14,32). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Quemadmodum magistri absencia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  inducit in discipulis negli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  [g]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  enciam, domini in ope\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  [ra]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  riis operis desidiam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (61\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Dominum deum solum adorabis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Mt 4,10; Lc 4,8). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Quemadmodum amicus suadet amico seruire domino, quesit potens ipsum ad descendendum, sapiens ad informandum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 6\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (63\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Quod uni ex minimis meis fecistis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Mt 25,40). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Quemadmodum rex suo nuncio, pater suo filio, magister suo discipulo inpensas ascribunt esse facta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (64\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Eicit ementes et vendentes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Mt 21,12; Mc 11,15). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Quemadmodum spurius ab hereditate eicitur, seruus destortus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  mercede privatur et discipulus incorrigibilis a scola expellitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 8\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (65\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Erit filius hominis in corde\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Mt 12,40). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Quemadmodum pater delectatur in suis filiis, magister in discipulis, amicus in sibi dilectis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (66\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Qui cognouit ueritatem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (vgl. Lc 12,47). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Quemadmodum mercator suas laudat merces, ut cicius emerimus, medicus suas medicinas, ut magis desiderauerimus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (?) ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 10\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (67\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Mouebatur aqua\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (vgl. Io 5,3). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Quemadmodum medicus facit virtuosum balneum, in quo disponit sanare egrotum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 11\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (69\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Hic est filius meus dilectus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Mt 3,17; 17,5). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Quemadmodum flos non potest suum odorem nec ignis calorem nec sol suum splendorem abscondere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 12\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (70\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Miserere mei domine, filii Dauid\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Mt 15,22). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Quemadmodum inferius per interuencium ad se facit uenire medicum, exclusus a gratia per intercessionem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 13\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (71\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Que placita sunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Io 8,29). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Quemadmodum exemplar proponitur pictori, liber scriptori, speculum mulieri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  et ideo in animis pii studemus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ||. Textabbruch.
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Die unvollst\u228 \'e4ndige Sammlung enth\u228 \'e4lt Predigten zur Fastenzeit, die nach dem einleitenden Bibelvers jeweils mit \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  Quemadmodum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   beginnen und viele Vergleiche zum Alltags- und Berufsleben ziehen. Vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Beobachtungen, S. 24, ferner \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 ders\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ., Wegweiser, S. 364 (diese Hs., mit falscher Signaturenangabe).}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 @Arial Unicode MS;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  72\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  -104\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22     {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Sermones de tempore II: Oct. PASC-Dom. 24 post PENT}}
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (72\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  In octauam pasce\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Cum esset sero die\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Io 20,19). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  In prenotatis uerbis, fratres karissimi, tria nobis sunt consideranda: Primo, quod discipuli in cenaculo clausis foribus sedebant et mortem magistri sui permaxime uigebant\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... Parallelhs.: Augsburg, UB, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 II. 1.2\u176 \'b0 5}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , 14\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (73\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Dominica secunda\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Ego cognosco oues meas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Io 10,14). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Hiis uerbis, fratres karissimi, describit bonitas pastoris ex cooperacione ad oues: Vnde ego sum pastor bonus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Io 10,11) ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (74\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Dom. 3: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Obsecro uos tamquam aduenas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (I Pt 2,11). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  In hac epistola, fratres karissimi, apostolus nos uocat aduenas et peregrinos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... Parallelhs.: Klosterneuburg, StiftsB, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[1].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Ms 450}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , 270\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (75\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Dom. 4: Lucas de Bitonto, vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Repertorium 4, S. 57, Nr. 102 (T32). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (76\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Dom. 5: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Vocem iocunditatis adnunciante\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Verba predicta, fratres karissimi, sunt incepcio misse et cantantur per totum mundum fortiter clamando\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... Vgl. II. 1.2\u176 \'b0 5, 20\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 6\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (77\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  De eodem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Si quid petieritis patrem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Io 16,23). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  In predicto sermone, fratres karissimi, dictum est de literatis, quod agere debeant\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... Vgl. II. 1.2\u176 \'b0 5, 20\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (78\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  De ascensione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Quis ascendit in montem domini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Ps 23,2). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  In predictis verbis, fratres karissimi, desiderabat scire sanctus propheta, qui illi sunt, qui post Christum in celum post hanc vitam sunt ascensuri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 8\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (79\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  De eodem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Ascendo ad patrem meum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Io 20,17). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Verba prenotata, fratres karissimi, sunt ipsius Christi et ultimo locutus ea fuit dilectis fidelibus et apostolis, qui aderant sue ascensioni\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (79\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Im Kopfsteg: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  De prudencia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Dominica post ascensionem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Estote prudentes et uigilate\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (I Pt 4,7). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  In verbis prenotatis, fratres karissimi, hortatur nos beatus Petrus apostolus ad tria\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... Vgl. II. 1.2\u176 \'b0 5, 22\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 10\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (80\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Dom. post oct. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Asc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Cum venerit paraclitus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Io 15,26). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Restaurat enim Christus inter Iudaeos verba sue sapiencie, fecerat inter eos opera sue potencie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 11\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (81\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  De sancto spiritu\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Repleti sunt omnes spiritu sancto\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Act 2,4). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  In hiis verbis, fratres karissimi, duo notantur, scilicet apostolorum ad spiritus sancti receptionem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... Vgl. II. 1.2\u176 \'b0 5, 23\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 12\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (82\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Veni sancte spiritus reple tuorum corda fidelium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (CAO 5327). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Verba prenotata, fratres karissimi, hodie lecta et recitata sunt in ecclesia sancta et cras et per totam septimam cantabuntur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 13\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (83\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Dominica prima post pentecosten\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b Jacobus de Voragine, vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Repertorium 3, S. 228, Nr. 96 (T44). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 14\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (84\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Dom. 2: Jacobus de Voragine, Nr. 91 (T42). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 15\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (85\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Dom. 3: Jacobus de Voragine, Nr. 94 (T43). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 16\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (86\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Dom. 4: Jacobus de Voragine, Nr. 98 (T45). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 17\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (87\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Dom. 5: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Relinque ibi munus tuum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Mt 5,24). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  In isto ewangelio, fratres karissimi, tria considerare debemus, que dominus docuit et precepit: primo oblationis immobilitatem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... Vgl. II. 1.2\u176 \'b0 5, 34\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 18\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (88\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Dom. 6: Jacobus de Voragine, Nr. 106 (T47). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 19\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (90\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Dom. 7: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Omnis arbor que non\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Mt 7,19). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Dominus enim, fratres karissimi, facit sicut bonus ortulanus et sapiens, qui bonos arbores in orto suo, scilicet regno celorum, plantat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... \u196 \'c4hnlicher Wortlaut bei Greculus, vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Repertorium 2, S. 216, Nr. 136 (T48). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 20\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (91\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Dom. 8: Jacobus de Voragine, Nr. 110 (T49). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 21\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (92\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Dom. 9: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Uenient dies\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Lc 19,43). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Istud ewangelium, fratres karissimi, ideo in mense Augusti legitur, quia ciuitas Ierusalem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... Jacobus de Voragine, Nr. 114 (T50); vgl. II. 1.2\u176 \'b0 5, 39\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 22\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (93\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Dom. 10: Jacobus de Voragine, Nr. 118 (T51). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 23\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (95\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Dom. 11: Jacobus de Voragine, Nr. 120 (T52). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 24\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (96\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Dom. 11: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sermo secundus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b Jacobus de Voragine, Nr. 124 (T53). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 25\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (97\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Dominica xviii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b Jacobus de Voragine, Nr. 142 (T59). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 26\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (98\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Dom. 19: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Simile est regnum celorum homini regi, qui fecit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Mt 22,2). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  In isto ewangelio, fratres karissimi, tria nobis sunt consideranda: Primo, quod rex magnus et potens nupcias filio suo fecit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... Vgl. II. 1.2\u176 \'b0 5, 50\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 27\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (99\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Dom. 20: Jacobus de Voragine, Nr. 146 (T61). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 28\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (100\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Dom. 21: Jacobus de Voragine, Nr. 149 (T62). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 29\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (101\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Dom. 22: Jacobus de Voragine, Nr. 153 (T63). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 30\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (102\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Dom. 23: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Filia mea modo defuncta est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Mt 9,18). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Secundum Ambrosium, fratres karissimi, in libro de sapientissimo Salomone\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... Vgl. II. 1.2\u176 \'b0 5, 54\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , ferner Jacobus de Voragine, Nr. 156 (T64) mit Mt 9,22 als Beginn. \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 31\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (103\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Dom. 24: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Celum et terra transibunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Mt 24,35). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Verba predicta, fratres karissimi, sunt verba iusticie, quia deus nobis in eis manifestat diem aduentus filii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... Vgl. II. 1.2\u176 \'b0 5, 2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Nach \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Beobachtungen, S. 24, sollen die meisten der hier \u252 \'fcberlieferten Sonn- und Festtagspredigten bis auf die zwischen 56\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  -71\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   eingeschobenen Fastenpredigten von dem Minoritenprediger und -theologen Conradus de Saxonia (Konrad Holtnicker) verfasst worden sein. Indessen konnten auf der Grundlage von \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Repertorium, im zweiten Teil mehrere Predigten Jacobus de Voragine zugewiesen werden. Hervorzuheben ist auch die Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung mit Augsburg, UB, II. 1.2\u176 \'b0 5. \endash  Die in der Hs. nicht aufgef\u252 \'fchrten Predigten f\u252 \'fcr den 12. bis 17. Sonntag fehlen auch in der Inkunabelausgabe (Ulm 1484; BSB-Ink I-110; GW M11628).}

