\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Benedicamus patrem et filium cum spiritu sancto\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (CAO 6239). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Nota patrem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   [debemus benedicere propter tria: Primo quod] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  nos ad ymaginem tuam et similitudinem tuam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   [creavi] ... 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   abgeschabt; Texterg\u228 \'e4nzungen nach dem Wortlaut der Predigt Nr. 264 (166\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  -168\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sermo de spiritu sancto\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Ueni sancte spiritus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (CAO 5327). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  In hac oracione mater ecclesia uel quelibet fidelis anima petit primo aduentum spiritus sancti, vbi dicit \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8218 \'82\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Veni sancte spiritus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8219 ? ... Parallelhs.: Graz, UB, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Ms. 1255}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Repertorium 7, S. 253, Nr. 92 (T39). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sermo de ascensione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Ad deum veniemus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Io 14,23). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Dominus recessurus de hoc mundo ad patrem consolatus discipulos suos promittens se ipsum in mentem eorum siue corda venire\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... Bertholdus Ratisbonensis, \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Repertorium 1, S. 483, Nr. 144 (T38). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sermo in diebus rogacionum bonus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Orate pro invicem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Iac 5,16). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Quamuis omni tempore sit orandum, precipue tamen est orandum diebus et temporibus ab ecclesia constitutis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... Parallelhs.: Kremsm\u252 \'fcnster, StiftsB, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[1].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 CC 124}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , 228\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (T34). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sermo de ascensione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Dominus quidem Ihesus postquam locutus est eis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Mc 16,19). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Duo hic occurrunt notanda: Primum est, quare dominus assumptus in celum esse dicatur. Secundum est, quare dominus ad dexteris dei sedere referatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... Ps.-Albertus Magnus, \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Repertorium 1, S. 117, Nr. 331 (T36).}

