\pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  -21\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Sermones de sanctis}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17  (S44-S85, S10)}}
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa60\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 6\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sermo de sancta Elizhabet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Elizhabet impletum est tempus pariendi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Lc 1,57). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  In ewangelio isto tria nobis sunt consideranda: Primum est, quod angelus predixit Zacharie natiuitatem Johannis baptiste\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... Parallelhs.: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Cgm 660}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , 267\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (S44). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sermo de sancto Johanne baptisto\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Nota, quod in vigilia sancti Johannis baptiste multa fiunt, que in nullius sanctorum vigilia fieri consueuerunt: Ignes magne fiunt. Hoc signat, quod Johannes erat lucerna ardens\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... (S44). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 8\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sermo de sancto Johanne baptisto\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Elizhabet vxor tua pariet tibi filius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (vgl. Lc 1,13-15). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Totum est pulcrum et totum est dulce, quitquid de beato Johanne lectatur et cantatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... Peregrinus de Oppeln, \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Repertorium 4, S. 568, Nr. 246; ebd. 7, S. 486, Nr. 58 (S44) ...\endash ... \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 31\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (18\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sermo de beata Katerina\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Omnis gloria eius filie regis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Ps 44,14). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Notandum, quod gloria beate Katerine triplex est. Quedam ante mortem, quedam in morte, quedam post mortem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 32\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (19\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sermo Katerine\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Domine deus, exaltasti super terram\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (vgl. Sir 51,13). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Hec verba bene possunt dicere beata Katherina regraciando domino deo de multis beneficiis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... Parallelhss.:{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[1].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17  Cgm 660}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , 274\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[2].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Clm 14899}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Repertorium 8, S. 706, Nr. 63 (S85). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 33\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (20\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sermo de sancto Johanne ewangelista bonus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Qui sunt hii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  gloria id est quam magni hii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  qui vt nubes volant\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (vgl. Is 60,8). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Qui vt nubes volant. Gloria id est qui pluuiam portant et arridam terram irrigant\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  exultetis cum eo in perpetuum in gloria. Amen.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   Honorius Augustodunensis, Speculum ecclesiae, sermo 3. Druck: PL 172, 831D-836D. Vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Repertorium 2, S. 721, Nr. 3 (S10). \endash  Darunter eine Predigt des Sifridus OP (de domus Teutonica): \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 23\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (12\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sermo de animabus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Mittite partes eis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (vgl. I Esr 8,10). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Consvetudo est, quando aliqui usque ad mortem infirmati uel usque ad mortem flagellati aut in carcere usque ad mortem cruciati sunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Repertorium 5, S. 432, Nr. 49 (S80).
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  M\u252 \'fcnchen, BSB, Cgm 660, 267\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  -274\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 : Nr. 6, 10-13, 15, 20, 27, 29, 32; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[3].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Clm 2631}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 : Nr. 21 (Rep. Nr. 170); Clm 14899: Nr. 24 (Rep. Nr. 56), 27 (Rep. Nr. 65), 32 (Rep. Nr. 63); Prag, NK, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[4].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 VI. E. 7}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 : Nr. 12 (Rep. Nr. 111), 15 (Rep. Nr. 119), 30 (Rep. Nr. 173); Wien, \u214 \'d6NB, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[5].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Cvp 4874}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 : Nr. 8 (Rep. Nr. 58).}

