\pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (21\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  -45\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Sermones de commune sanctorum}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17  (C2-C17)}}
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa60\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 34\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (21\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sermo communis de apostolis bonus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Ego vos elegi de mundo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (vgl. Io 15,16). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Dominus ostendit in hoc verbo, quod non solum nobis est eligere eum, nisi et ipse prius elegerit nos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... Parallelhs.:\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  Wien, \u214 \'d6NB, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[9].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Cvp 4874}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Repertorium 7, S. 493, Nr. 136 (C2). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 35\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (22\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sermo de apostolis communis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Nimis honorati sunt amici tui\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Ps 138,17). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Cum dominus dicat: Ego quos amo, arguo et castigo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Apc 3,19). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Quomodo dicitur tunc, quod amici dei nimis honorati sunt. Apostolus dicit ad Corinthios: Tamquam purgamenta huius mundi facti sunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (I Cor 4,13) ... (C2). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 36\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (23\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Posui uos vt eatis et fructum afferatis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Io 15,16). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Dominus noster tamquam bonus ortulanus volens plantare ortum sponse sue\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 56\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (43\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sermo sacerdotis de noua missa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sacerdos dei benedicite domino\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (vgl. Ps 102,20-22; 133,2; 134,19-20). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Quare quia dominus vos multum honorauit, vnde nota: Sacerdotes deus pater audit spiritualiter et exaudit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... (C17). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 57\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (44\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sermo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   [de] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  communibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   [sanctorum]\u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Deum time et mandata eius obserua\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Ecl 12,13). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  In verbis istis dicuntur duo: Primo quid habendum sit meritius in corde quam timor dei. Secundo quid sit gerendum exercicius in opere quam obseruancia mandatorum dei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 58\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (44\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  -45\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  De confessione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Confitemini alterutrum peccata vestra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Iac 5,16). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Fratres mei, de confessione uobis propono hic aliqua utilia dante deo dicere, scilicet primo cui confiteri debeatis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ut se non excuset, sed pocius accuset. Uera, id est nec falsa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  || Textabbruch; Parallelhs.: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Cgm 658}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , 210\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  -212\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (ebenfalls unvollst\u228 \'e4ndig, Textschluss abweichend). \endash  Darunter Predigten, die Conradus de Saxonia zugewiesen werden: \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 41\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (25\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  -31\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sermo communis et valde bonus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Mouebo celum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Agg 2,22). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Super ista verba dicit quedam glosa, quod dominus movet celum et terram mirabiliter et uenit desiderabiliter cunctis gentibus et repleuit domum istam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Mohan\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Initia, S. 240, nennt als Textzeugen Graz, UB, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[1].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Ms. 613}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , 220\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  -229\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ; weitere nach Renate \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Schipke\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Die mittelalterlichen Schneeberger Handschriften der S\u228 \'e4chsischen Landesbibliothek Dresden. Berlin 1985 (Handschrifteninventare der Deutschen Staatsbibliothek 8), S. 44: Wien, Schottenstift, StiftsB, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[2].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Ms 296}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ; Vatikanstadt, BAV,{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[3].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Cod. Vat. lat. 804,3/104}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 45\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (34\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sermo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  communis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Tunc videbunt filium hominis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Lc 21,27). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Quia, ut dicit apostolus, canet enim tuba et mortui, qui in Christo sunt, resurgent primi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (I Th 4,16) ... Parallelhs.: Vatikanstadt, BAV, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[4].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Cod. Borg. lat. 180, Nr. 1}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ; vgl. Codices Burghesiani Bibliothecae Vaticanae. Beschrieben von Anneliese \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Maier\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . Vatikanstadt 1952 (Studi e testi 170), S. 456. \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 53\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (40\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Qui bene presunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (I Tm 5,17). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  In verbis apostoli propositis commendatur rectorum circa subditos diligencia, cum dicitur: Qui bene presunt presbiteri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... Conradus de Saxonia, \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Repertorium 1, S. 777, Nr. 388 (C14). \endash  Predigt mit Zuweisung an Bertholdus Ratisbonensis: \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 46\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (34\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Incipiens tunc, id est in iudicio dicit glosa, nouissimum locum tenere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Lc 14,9\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 ). Cum dominus ad iudicium venerit, multi incipient nouissimum locum tenere et hec faciunt diuersa peccata, que homines in hoc mundo committunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... Parallelhs.: Klosterneuburg, StiftsB, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[5].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Ms 451}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , 176\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Assisi {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[6].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 432: Nr. 40}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   (Rep. Nr. 170); Prag, NK, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[7].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 VI. E. 7: Nr. 43}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   (Rep. Nr. 125); Wien, \u214 \'d6NB, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[8].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Cod. 4874}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 : Nr. 34 (Rep. Nr. 136), 37 (Rep. Nr. 139).}

