\pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\tx4620\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (46\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  -53\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Sermones de tempore}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17  (T26-T39)}}
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa60\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 59\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (46\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  De passione domini sermo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Vos omnes, qui transitis per viam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Lam 1,12). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Hiis diebus sancta ecclesia representat fletum et dolorem. Primo in camparum suspensione, per quod significatur silencium predicacionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... (T26). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 60\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (46\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  De passione domini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sicio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Io 19,28). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Christus pendens in cruce. Hoc uerbum uicinus morti dixit \u8218 \'82Sicio\u8219 ?. In hoc uerbo tria sunt consideranda, scilicet: Que fuit sitis Christi, que causa sitis Christi, que vtilitas sitis Christi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Repertorium 8, S. 561, Nr. 126 (T26). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 61\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (47\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  De passione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Hic uoce magna clamauit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (vgl. Mt 27,50-52; Lc 23,45-46). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Nota quatuor sunt circa passionem domini consideranda. Primo cur per lignum pocius quam per aliam mortem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... (T26) ...\endash ... \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 69\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (51\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  De ascensione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Uado ad eum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Io 16,5). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Quasi dicat: \u8218 \'82Vado\u8219 ? immo ad patrem, qui ante tempora me incarnari disposuit, vado ad eum per assumptam humanitatem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Repertorium 8, S. 561, Nr. 132 (T36). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 70\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (52\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sermo de sancto spiritu\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Apparuerunt apostolis dispertite lingue\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Act 2,3). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Nota quod spiritus sanctus duobus modis apparuit, scilicet invisibiliter et uisibiliter. Inuisibiliter cum castis et bonis mentibus illapsus fuit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... (T39). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 71\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (53\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sermo de penthecoste\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Si quis diligit me\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Io 14,23). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Omnia bona nostra, que facimus, commendabilis ualde sunt in eo, quod multum ipsa delectant deum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... Bertholdus Ratisbonensis, \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Repertorium 1, S. 475, Nr. 31 (T39); vgl. auch Laurentius \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Casutt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Die Beziehungen einer Freiburger Handschrift zum lateinischen Predigtwerk Bertholds von Regensburg, in: Zeitschrift f\u252 \'fcr schweizerische Kirchengeschichte 56 (1962), S. 73-112, ebd. S. 103, Nr. 262.
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  M\u252 \'fcnchen, BSB, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Cgm 660}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 265\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  -266\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 : Nr. 62, 63; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[1].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Clm 2631}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 : Nr. 60 (Rep. Nr. 126), 64 (Rep. Nr. 130), 65 (Rep. Nr. 131), 69 (Rep. Nr. 132).}

