\uc1
\pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (54\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  -74\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Sermones de diversis}}
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa60\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 72\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (54\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) In kleinerem Schriftgrad im Kopfsteg: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sermo de matrimonio bonus valde\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Crescite et multiplicamini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Gn 1,28). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Istud uerbum confundit quosdam hereticos, quorum uita, fidis et doctrina falsa est, qui dicunt, quod in matrimonio nullus possit saluari\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 73\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (55\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sermo de ascensione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Iterum relinquo mundum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Io 16,28). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Beatus est ille, qui postquam in morte relinquit mundum, vadit ad patrem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... Bertholdus Ratisbonensis, \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Repertorium 1, S. 475, Nr. 29 (T33); vgl. auch \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Casutt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Beziehungen, S. 102, Nr. 244. \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 74\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (56\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sermo de oracione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Multum ualet deprecacio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Iac 5,16). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Tantum valet, puto, quod nullus hominum valet exprimere. Vnde vellem, quod hodie angelus de celo veniret\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... Parallelhs.: M\u252 \'fcnchen, UB, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 8\u176 \'b0 Cod. ms. 85}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , 303\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 96\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (71\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Item de oracionibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Multum valet deprecatio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Iac 5,16). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Hic attendendum est, quod oracio iusti debet esse munda, debet esse discreta, debet esse deuota, debet esse secreta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 97\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (72\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  De peccatis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Confitemini alterutrum peccata uestra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Iac 5,16). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Karissime, ut eo libencius confitearis tuas iniquitates, pensare debes confessionis vtilitatem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... Conradus de Saxonia, \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Repertorium 1, S. 757, Nr. 148 (T34). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 98\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (73\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Amico fideli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Sir 6,15). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Notare debetis, quod tria genera amicorum in sacra scriptura inueniuntur. Inueniuntur amici corporales, inueniuntur amici infernales, inueniuntur nichilominus amici celestes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... \endash  Darunter weitere Predigten des Conradus de Saxonia: \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 79\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (61\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Domine, si uis, potes me mundare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Mt 8,2). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Leprosus iste peccatorem significat, qui coram deo et angelis et omnibus sanctis fetidior et abhominiabilior est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Repertorium 1, S. 751, Nr. 57 (T13), \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 81\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  Nr. 143 (T33), \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 82\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  Nr. 145 (T33). \endash  Peregrinus de Oppeln: \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 83\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (63\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  De odio bonorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Nolite mirari si odit vos mundus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (I Io 3,13). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Notandum, quod propter tres causas serui dei non debent mirari \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ... \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Repertorium 4, S. 562, Nr. 168 (S79). \endash  Vier Predigten \u252 \'fcber die Beichte: \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 77\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (59\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sermo de penitencia bonus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Querite dominum dum inveniri potest\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Is 55,6). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  In verbis propositis sanctus propheta duo nobis consulit facere. Primo, vt dominum, dum inveniri potest, queramus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...; \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 87, 90-91\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (66\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , 68\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Nachweis im Initienregister. \endash  Drei Predigten zu Allerseelen (S80): \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 84\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (64\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sermo de animabus\u8249 \'8b Miseremini mei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Iob 19,21). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Hodie omnes parentes nostri, qui cruciantur in purgatorio, lamentabili voce clamant ad nos dicentes: Miseremini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...; \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 85-86\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (64-65\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Nachweis im Initienregister.
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Prag, Archiv der Prager Burg / B des Metropolitankapitels, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[1].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Cod. F 46}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 : Nr. 91 (Rep. Nr. 95).}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 @Arial Unicode MS;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (74\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  -75\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Sermones de martyribus}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17  (C4-C5)}}
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 99\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (74\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  De martiribus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Reddet deus mercedem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (vgl. Sap 10,17). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  In verbis propositis aperte docemur, quod deus reddet vnicuique secundum opera sua et, prout mereamur in via, recipiemus in patria\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... Parallelhs.: Uppsala, UB, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 C 295}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , 139\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (mit abweichendem Bibelthema, C5). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 100\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (74\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  De vno martyre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Dignus est operarius mercede sua\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Lc 10,7). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Scilicet notare debetis, quod dominus noster diuersimode remunerat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (!, vielm.: remunerare) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  potest laborem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... (C4).}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 @Arial Unicode MS;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (75\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  -76\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Sermones de rege Salomo}}
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 101\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (75\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Quasi a facie colubri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Sir 21,2). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sapientissimus rex Salomon monet hodie nos omnes, vt peccatum summo opere fugiamus. Quare autem peccatum fugiendum, ostenditur ex suo multiplici nocumento\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 102\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (75\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Quasi a facie colubri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Sir 21,2). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sapientissimus rex Salomon monet et consulit omnibus hominibus, ut fugiant peccatum. Sed, proh dolor, paucissimi inueniuntur in mundo, qui velint peccata dimittere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 @Arial Unicode MS;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (76\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  -86\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Sermones de tempore et de sanctis. Pars hiemalis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (T1-T6; S8-S10, S20, S79)
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 103\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (76\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  De aduentu\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Ueniet desideratus cunctis gentibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Agg 2,8). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Rumores ualde desiderabiles annunciat nobis propheta, cum dicit: Ueniet desideratus. Ipse enim est desiderabilis ad uidendum, ad audiendum, ad habendum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... (T1). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 104\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (76\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  De natiuitate\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Hec dies, quam fecit dominus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Ps 117,24). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  In verbis istis psalmus commendat nobis sollempnitatem huius diei. Scilicet notandum, quod est hec dies gracie et est dies iusticie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... (T6). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 105\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (77\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  De sancto Stephano\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Stephanus plenus gracia et fortitudine\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Act 6,8). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  In verbis propositis beatus Stephanus commendatur a duobus: Primo agere plenitudine, cum dicit: Stephanus plenus gracia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... Peregrinus de Oppeln, \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Repertorium 4, S. 565, Nr. 203 (S9) ...\endash ...\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 119\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (84\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  De animabus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Notandum quod quattuor sunt loca, ad que anime perueniunt, cum de hoc seculo discedunt et illa quattuor loca ostendit nobis Ihesus pendens in crvce\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 120\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (85\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Nota ergo, quod quattuor sunt genera suffragiorum, que maxime defunctis prosunt, scilicet fidelium et amicorum oracio, elemosinarum largicio, salutaris hostie ymolacio et ieiuniorum obseruacio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 121\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (85\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Cum appropinquaret dominus Iherusalem uidens ciuitatem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (vgl. Lc 19,41-42). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sed notandum, quod sacra scriptura testatur dominum nostrum Ihesum Christum ter fleuisse: Primo fleuit in die natiuitatis sue sicut ceteri pueri et de hoc fletu dicit Sapiencia vii\u176 \'b0: Primam uocem similem omnibus plorans\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Sap 7,3) ... \endash  Darunter Heiligenfeste aus dem Sommerteil: \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 108\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (79\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  De diuisione apostolorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b (15.7.) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Estote ergo prudentes sicut serpentes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Mt 10,16). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Verba proposita dixit Ihesus discipulis suis, quando ipsos misit in mundum predicare regnum dei. Sciebat enim, quod duo genera hominum eis multum essent contraria\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 114\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (82\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Laurencii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b (10.8.) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Dispersit, dedit pauperibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Ps 111,9; II Cor 9,9). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Istud verbum, fratres karissimi, scriptum est in psalmo et bene conuenit beato Laurencio, cui vitam laudabilem facit precipue elemozinarum largicio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... (S56). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 117\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (83\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  De assumpcione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b (15.8.) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Extendit Noe manum et apprehendit columbam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (vgl. Gn 8,9). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Pro Noe, fratres karissimi, possumus intelligere Christum filium dei, per columbam beatam virginem, per archam celum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... (S59). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 118\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (84\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  De assumpcione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Astitit regina a dextris tuis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Ps 44,10). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Notandum, quod uestra virgo astitit dillecto\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  suo filio in die passionis propter tria: propter audiendum, videndum et compaciendum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... (S59).}

