\uc1
\pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (86\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  -99\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Sermones de tempore et de sanctis. Pars aestivales}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (T18/4-T34; S29-S70)
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa60\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 122\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (86\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sermo in XL\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 a\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Cum ieiunasset quadraginta diebus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Mt 4,2). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Cum dominus noster solus ieiunauerit, nobis exemplum ieiunandi dedit, sed notandum, quod duo circa ieiunium nobis consideranda occurrunt. Primo qualiter ieiunare debeamus, secundo que sint vtilitas ieiunandi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... (T18/4). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 123\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (87\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Labora sicut bonus miles Christi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (II Tm 2,3, 5). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  De omni statu hominum ad sanctorum ordinem assumuntur, vt nullus excusetur, nullus disperet. Non solum monachi et abbates, non solum clerici et pontifices, sed etiam laici et milites regis in gloriam sunt adepti sicut sanctus hic Wenczeslaus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... Nicolaus de Gorra, \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Repertorium 4, S. 293, Nr. 567; Thomas de Lisle, ebd. 5, S. 651, Nr. 312; ebd. 8, S. 510, Nr. 12. \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 124\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (87\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  De sancta Margareta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Simile est regnum celorum homini negociatori\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Mt 13,45). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Notandum, quod tres negociatores in sacra scriptura inueniuntur: Primus negociator est Christus, secundus est omnis doctor verus, tercius est diabolus iniquus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... (S47) ...\endash ... \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 140\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (96\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  De natiuitate beate virgine\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Egredietur virga de radice Yesse\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Is 11,1). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Consvetudo erat, quod antiqui reges et principes suum natalem celebrabant et magnum festum faciebant\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... Peregrinus de Oppeln, \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Repertorium 4, S. 561, Nr. 155; ebd. 9, S. 410, Nr. 72 (S65). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 141\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (98\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  De sancto Bartolomeo sermo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Arta via est, que ducit ad uitam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Mt 7,14). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Beatus Matheus videns hodie intrare beatum Bartolomeum ad uitam eternam ostendit nobis viam, postquam intrauit, vt sequamur eius vestigia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... Peregrinus de Oppeln, \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Repertorium 4, S. 561, Nr. 152; ebd. 9, S. 410, Nr. 71 (S61). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 142\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (98\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  De sancta Maria Magdalena\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Conuertisti planctum meum in gaudium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Ps 29,12). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Hec verba bene possunt conuenire beate Marie Magdalene. In quibus verbis duo tanguntur: Primo luctus Marie, secundo consolacio Christi. Primo luctus siue ploratus Marie notatur in eius conuersione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... (S49). \endash  Darunter Predigten bekannter Verfasser: \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 127\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (89\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  De rogacionibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Nota quod letanie bis fiunt in anno, scilicet in festo beati Marci, que dicitur letania maior et tribus diebus ante ascensionem domini, que dicitur letania minor\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... Druck: Legenda aurea, ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Graesse\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , cap. 70, S. 312f. (T34, Schluss abweichend). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 139\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (95\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sermo Michaelis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Michahel magnus princeps stat pro filiis populi mei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Dn 12,1). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  In hiis verbis commendatur a tribus sanctus Michahel et omnes angeli: Primo a fortitudine, ibi \u8250 \'9bMichahel\u8249 \'8b, qui interpretatur: Quis vt deus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... Peregrinus de Oppeln, S\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 chneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Repertorium 4, S. 570, Nr. 287; ebd. 9, S. 412, Nr. 101 (S70). \endash  Heiligenfeste aus dem Winterteil: \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 126\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (89\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  De sancto Nicolao\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sic luceat lumen vestrum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Mt 5,16). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Notandum, quod quidam homines lucent sicut luna noua, que lucet tantum in principio noctis. Tunc sunt iterum alii, qui lucent sicut luna plena, que per totam noctem lucet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... (S3). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 131\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (91\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  De aduento\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (!)\u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Querite dominum dum inveniri potest\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Is 55,6). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Videndum autem, quando, vbi et quibus queritur Christus. In querendo autem consideranda est temporis oportunitas, loci congruitas, querencium humilitas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (am Rand: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  habilitas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) ... (T1). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 137\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (94\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  De aduentu\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Prope est dominus omnibus invocantibus eum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Ps 144,18). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Fratres karissimi, sanctus propheta alloquitur nos et consolatur nos peccatores omnipotens deus, qui redimit nos sanguine suo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Repertorium 8, S. 726, Nr. 2 (T1). \endash  Darunter Palmbaumtraktat als Predigt: \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 138\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (94\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Ascendam in palmam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Ct 7,8). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  In sacra scriptura per palmam crvx Christi interdum penitencia. Ista arbor, scilicet penitencia, dicitur habere iiii\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 or\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   ramos et in quolibet ramo auem unam et florem unum. Primus ramus est consideracio sui, quando homo se agnoscit per confessionem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... Vgl. Philipp\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22  Strauch,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   Palma contemplationis, in: Beitr\u228 \'e4ge zur Geschichte der deutschen Sprache und Literatur 48 (1924), S. 335-375, bes. S. 349 (zum Predigtcharakter der Palmbaumallegorie), S. 360-366 (Inhaltswiedergabe), S. 367-373 (Druck der E-Redaktion mit \u220 \'dcberschneidungen zur vorliegenden Fassung); Wolfgang\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22  Fleischer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , in: \u178 \'b2VL 7 (1989), Sp. 277-287.
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Assisi {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 432}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 : Nr. 139 (Rep. Nr. 127); Prag, Archiv der Prager Burg / B des Metropolitankapitels, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[1].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Cod. F 46}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 : Nr. 139 (Rep. Nr. 101), 140 (Rep. Nr. 72), 141 (Rep. Nr. 71).}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 @Arial Unicode MS;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (99\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  -102\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Sermones de commune sanctorum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (C4-C5)
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 143\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (99\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sermo communis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Inuenit Moyses lignum in deserto\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (vgl. Ex 15,25). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Marat dicitur quasi amarum, cum enim populus egypciacus moraretur in deserto xl annis, antequam venisset ad terram promissionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 144\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (100\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Qui non accipit crvcem suam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Mt 10,38). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Vult igitur dominus, vt ipsum sequamur et crvcem tollamus. Sicut legitur in libro iudicum, quod iudici regis Abimelech scilicet Siccimite se ei opposuerunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... Bertholdus Ratisbonensis, \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Repertorium 1, S. 488, Nr. 211 (C4). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 145\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (101\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  De martiribus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sancti per fidem vicerunt regna\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Hbr 11,33). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Ista verba dicit apostolus Paulus ad ebreos de istis sanctis vel de isto sancto, cuius festum hodie celebramus. De isto sancto primo debemus notare, quod iste sanctus vicit regnum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... (C5).}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 @Arial Unicode MS;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (102\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  -111\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Sermones de sanctis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (S1-S11)
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa60\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 146\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (102\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sermo de beata virgine\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Vidi portam in domo domini clausam et dixit angelus domini ad me: Porta hec, quam vides, non aperietur et homo non transibit per eam et clausa erit in eternum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (vgl. Ez 44,2) ... (S5). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 147\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (103\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Nota Andree\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Proposito sibi gaudio sustinuit crucem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Hbr 12,2). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Hec verba dixit apostolus Paulus de domino nostro Ihesu Christo, que sic exponuntur \u8218 \'82proposito sibi gaudio\u8219 ? et hec verba bene conueniunt beato Andree, cuius hodie festum celebramus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... (S1). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 148\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (104\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sermo secundus Andree\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Venite post me\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Mt 4,19; Mc 1,17). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Hec uerba dixit dominus ad beatum Petrvm et beatum Andream fratrum eius. In hiis verbis duo notare debetis. Primo domini vocacionem, ubi dicit: Venite post me\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... (S1) ...\endash ... \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 153\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (108\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  De sancto Johanne ewangelista\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Cibauit illum pane vite\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Sir 15,3). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Hec verba lecta sunt modo in epistola, que bene conueniunt beato Johanni, cuius festiuitas hodie celebratur. Dicit glosa: Cibauit eum. Notare debetis, quod homo triplici pane cibatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... (S10). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 154\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (109\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sermo de omnibus sanctis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Angelus domini apparuit in sompni Ioseph\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Mt 2,19). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Uidi supra montem Sion agnum stantem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Apc 14,1). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Ista uerba modo lecta sunt in epistola et beatus Johannes dicit ea sic: Vidi supra montem etc. Habentes nomen eius et nomen patris eius scriptum in frontibus suis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... (S11, da die Predigt von dem Kindermord zu Bethlehem handelt). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 155\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (110\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sermo domini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Vbi est, qui natus est rex Iudeorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Mt 2,2). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Ista verba modo lecta sunt in ewangelio, que sic exponuntur, quando dominus noster Ihesus Christus natus fuit de uirgine Maria, multa signa claruerunt in diuersis partibus orbis terre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... (T6).
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Assisi {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 432}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 : Nr. 149 (Rep. Nr. 48), 150 (Rep. Nr. 54).}

