\uc1
\pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (111\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  -123\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Sermones de tempore et de sanctis. Pars aestivalis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (T18/4-T39; S21-S66)
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa60\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 156\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (111\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Exaltacione domini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Ego si exaltatus fuero a terra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Io 12,32). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Hic locutus est Ihesus significans, qua morte moriturus erat. Erat enim exaltatus, id est eleuatus in crvce\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Repertorium 9, S. 199, Nr. 58 (S66). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 157\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (111\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  De ascensione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Fratres karissimi, hodie celebramus, quomodo dominus post resurrectionem suam venit ad discipulos suos, vt exprobraret in credulitatem illorum et duriciam cordis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... Parallelhs.: Kremsm\u252 \'fcnster, StiftsB, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 CC 70}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , 227\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (T36). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 158\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (111\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  De pentecostes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (!)\u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Fratres caritas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (!, vielm.: carissimi), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Christus alloquitur nos: Si diligitis me, mandata mea seruate\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Io 14,15). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sed quicumque dicit, quod Christum diligit et opera eius non facit, ille propriis verbis se dampnat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... Parallelhs.: Kremsm\u252 \'fcnster, StiftsB, CC 70, 228\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (T39) ...\endash ... \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 173\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (121\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Conuertimini ad me\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Ioel 2,12). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Non est mirum, si seruus rogat dominum uel si hiis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (!, vielm.: ille), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  qui fecit iniuriam, rogat eum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  vt sit archa veri Noe, id est Christus, tricamerata per contricionem, per confessionem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   [et] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  satisfaccionem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . Guilelmus Arvernus, Supplementum tractatus novi de poenitentia, cap. 22: De motivis conversionis ad deum. Druck: Opera omnia 2,2. Paris 1674, S. 238f. Z. 13. Vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Bloomfield\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Incipits 988; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Michaud-Quantin\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Sommes, S. 28f., Anm. 20; nach \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Repertorium 3, S. 183, Nr. 55 (T18/4), Jacobus de Vitriaco zugeschrieben. \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 174\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (122\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sermo de dedicacione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Terribilis est locus iste\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Gn 28,17). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Primo dicitur: Terribilis est locus iste, karissimi, attendite, priusquam hic ecclesia constitueretur, ista terra erat sicut alie terre apta mundanis utilitatibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... (C11). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 175\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (122\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Exurgens Maria abiit in montana\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Lc 1,39). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Postquam Maria, id est anima fidelis, per annunciacionem angeli, id est alicuius predicatoris, Christum, id est propositum religionis, in semetipsa concepit, non manet ociosa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... Parallelhs.: N\u252 \'fcrnberg, StB, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[1].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Cent. V 82}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Nr. 1 (S28). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 176\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (123\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  De annunciacione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Egredietur virga de radice Yesse\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Is 11,1). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Saluo mistico intellectu quo credatur, quod de radice Yesse, id est de stirpe Iesse, egressa est virgo Maria\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... Parallelhs.: N\u252 \'fcrnberg, StB, Cent. V 82, Nr. 1 (S28).
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Prag, NK, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[2].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 VI. E. 7}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 : Nr. 166 (Rep. Nr. 66).}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 @Arial Unicode MS;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (123\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  -133\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Sermones de tempore et de sanctis. Pars hiemalis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (T1-T10; S1-S29)
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa60\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 177\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (123\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  De aduentu\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Rorate celi desuper\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Is 45,8). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Celi sunt angeli rorantes, id est annunciantes Christum Abrahe et beate virgini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... (T1). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 178\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (123\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  De sancto Andrea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Venite post me\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Mt 4,19). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Homines errantes de nocte multum gaudent ad aspectum luminis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... Parallelhs.: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Clm 12665}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , 21\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (S1). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 179\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (124\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sermo de sancto Andrea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Venite post me\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Mt 4,19). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Notandum est, cur dominus discipulos elegerit primo et non alios. Ad hoc responderi potest dominum hoc fecisse, ut astuciam diaboli sua astucia superaret\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... (S1) ...\endash ... \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 194\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (132\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  De sancto Greorio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  sermo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Si quis mihi ministrauerit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Io 12,26). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Uere si domino utiliter et digne ministrauerimus, mercedem coram domino et sanctis habebimus. Libenter autem possumus illi ministrare, qui nobis ministrauit plus quam xxx annis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... (S29). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 195\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (132\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  De annunciacione sermo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Missus est angelus Gabriel\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Lc 1,26). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Quando laboratur pro pace, ubi magna discordia est, tunc iiii fiunt principaliter, per quot\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  firmatur pax\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... (S28). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 196\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (133\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  De aduentu domini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Missus est Gabriel\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (vgl. Lc 1,26). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  In hoc ewangelio sunt nobis tria precipue consideranda. Primo, quod dei filius aduentum tuum mundo prenunciauit. Secundo, quod de virgine concipi, nasci et nutriri uoluit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... (T1). \endash  Predigten bekannter Verfasser: \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 185\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (126\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sermo de sancta Lucia vel Katerina\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Tota pulcra es, amica mea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Ct 4,7). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  In verbis istis commendatur beata N., cuius hodie festum celebramus et hec in tribus: Primo a uirtutum ornatu et pulcritudine, cum dicitur: Tota pulcra es\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... Greculus, \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Repertorium 2, S. 222, Nr. 195 (S7, S85). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 187\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (127\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  De natiuitate Christi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Paruulus natus est nobis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Is 9,6). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  In hoc verbo tria notantur principaliter: Primo nascentis benignitas, ibi \u8218 \'82Puer natus est\u8219 ?, secundo nascendi nobis nouitas, ibi \u8218 \'82Filius datus est\u8219 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... Aldobrandinus de Cavalcantibus, \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Repertorium 1, S. 151, Nr. 12 (T6).
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  BSB, M\u252 \'fcnchen, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[1].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Cgm 660}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 256\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  -263\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 : Nr. 181, 184, 186, 189, 194; Prag, NK, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[2].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 VI. E. 7}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 : Nr. 191 (Rep. Nr. 31), 195 (Rep. Nr. 48); Wien, \u214 \'d6NB, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[3].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Cod. 4874}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 : Nr. 183 (Rep. Nr. 5).}

