\pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (134\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  -137\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Sermones de sancto Wenceslao duce Boemiae}}
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 197\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (134\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Im Fu\u223 \'dfsteg: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sermo de sancto Venczeslao\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Si quis mihi ministraverit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Io 12,26). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  In verbis istis tanguntur duo, scilicet ministerium beati Wenczeslay et premium. Primum cum dicit: Si quis mihi ministraverit, secundum cum dicit: honorificabit eum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Circa primum sciendum est, quod beatus Ve\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  [nczeslaus] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ministrauit Christo quattuor modis, scilicet elemosinam dando, fidem Christi dilatando\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 198\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (136\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b[De] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Translacione sancti Venczeslai\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Post terminum passionis sue diuina reuelacione pluribus fidelium et pluries innotuit, ut corpus athlete Christi Vencesslai transferretur in ecclesiam sancti Viti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 @Arial Unicode MS;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  137\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  -149\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Sermones de commune sanctorum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (C2-C11)
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa60\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 199\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (137\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sermo de uno martyre vel de Christo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Qui mihi ministrat me\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Io 12,26). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sciens dominus multos decipi in eo, quod credunt se esse ministros eius. Ideo in hac sentencia examinat unum quemque nostrum, si sit eius minister dei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... (C4). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 200\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (138\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sermo de confessore\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b (138\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Beati sunt serui illi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Lc 12,37). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Dominus noster Ihesus Christus non wlt electos suos exspectacionis dilacione deficere et ideo hortatur eos constanter in bonis operibus vigilare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... (C7). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 201\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (138\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  De uno confessore\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (?)\u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Filii Sion, exulate et letamini in domino\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Ioel 2,23). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Aliquis paterfamilias, cum multum diligit filium suum et intendit promocioni eius, solet in disciplina et sciencia querere, si aliquem bonum doctorem, qui diligenter instruat filium suum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 214\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (146\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Nota\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Si ergo sermonem meum seruauerit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Io 8,52). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Verba domini. Primo debet seruari in aure, vnde Ysae dicit: Inclinate aurem vestram et venite ad me\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... (Is 55,3). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 215\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (146\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sermo de martyribus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Stabunt iusti in magna constancia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Sap 5,1). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Hic describitur status siue gaudium justorum et status malorum in die iudicii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... Parallelhs.: Uppsala, UB, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 C 189}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , 106\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (C5). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 216\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (147\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sermo de de\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  [dicacione] (?)\u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Suspiciens Ihesus vidit illum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Lc 19,5). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  In verbis istis notare possumus, quod dominus videt v genera hominum, scilicet primo tribulatos ut eripiat, secundo deuotos vt in oracione eos exaudiat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... (C11). \endash  Darunter Predigten bekannter Verfasser sowie Predigten \u252 \'fcber Heiligenfeste: \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 202\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (139\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Item de uno\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   [confessore?]\u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Lex veritatis fuit in ore eius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Mal 2,6). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Bonum Morsellum infert ori suo, qui gustui suo spirituali ingerit legem Christi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... Nicolaus Byard, \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Repertorium 4, S. 246, Nr. 211 (C2); Petrus de sancto Benedicto, ebd. 4, S. 799, Nr. 228 (C7). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 208\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (142\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sermo de sancto Thoma\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Affer manum tuam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Io 20,27). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Dauid inspiratus spiritu sancto dixit: Ignitum eloquium tuum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... (Ps 118,140). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Quando terrenus aliquis dominus suos plures seruos alloquitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... Parallelhs.: N\u252 \'fcrnberg, StB, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[1].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Cent. V 74}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , 5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (S8). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 209\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (143\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sermo de sancto Stephano\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Intendens in celum vidit gloriam dei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Act 7,55). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Wlgariter dicitur: Ubi amor, ibi oculus. Scilicet quod beati Stephani amor erat in celo, non sine causa intendebat, id est intentus mente tendebat in celum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... (S9). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 217\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (147\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  De sancto Philipo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Domine, ostende nobis patrem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Io 14,8). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Notare debetis, quod sanctis non sufecit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  in celo nec in terra, nisi videant patrem et nisi videant deitatem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... Bertholdus Ratisbonensis, \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Repertorium. 1, S. 4, Nr. 83 (S32). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 218\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (148\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  De sancto Philipo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Philipe, qui vidit me, vidit et patrem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Io 14,9). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Videtur dominus per fidem in mundo, videbitur per speciem in celo, hic obscure ibi clare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... Leo OCist, \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Repertorium 4, S. 32, Nr. 245 (S32). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 219\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (149\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  De sancto Philipo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  In domo patris mei mansiones multe sunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Io 14,2). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Dominus pater sicut imperator vel rex facilis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (?), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  magnus et potens tres domus construxit, scilicet carceris pro malefactoribus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Repertorium 7, S. 120, Nr. 119 (S32).
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Assisi {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[3].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 432}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 : Nr. 219 (Rep. Nr. 119); Wien, \u214 \'d6NB, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[2].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Cod. 4874}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 : Nr. 199 (Rep. Nr. 145), 200 (Rep. Nr. 148), 203 (Rep. Nr. 151), 205 (Rep. Nr. 152).}

