\pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (150\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  -161\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Sermones de tempore}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (T1-T64)
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 220\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (150\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Erunt sygna in sole\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Lc 21,25). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Tantis signis Christi? Ideo, que contingunt in sole materiali. In Christo uero sole magna signa erunt quam sole materiali precesserunt et hoc est quattuor: Obscuracio in passione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... Nr. 3 (T1); weitere Predigten aus Graz, UB, Ms. 1255: \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 221\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  Nr. 4 (T2), \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 222\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  Nr. 5 (T3), \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 223\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  Nr. 13 (T13), \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 224\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  Nr. 16 (T11), \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 225\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  Nr. 20 (T12), \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 226\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  Nr. 22 (T13), \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 227\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  Nr. 23 (T14), \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 228\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  Nr. 24 (T15), \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 229\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  Nr. 27 (T16), \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 230\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  Nr. 34 (T18/4), \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 231\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  Nr 37 (T20), \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 232\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  Nr. 39 (T21), \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 233\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  Nr. 44 (T23), \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 234\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  Nr. 46 (T24), \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 235\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  Nr. 60 (T28/2), \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 236\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  Nr. 61 (T28/2), \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 237\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  Nr. 78 (T34), \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 238\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  Nr. 80 (T34), \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 239\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  Nr. 87 (T39), \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 240\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  Nr. 93 (T40), \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 241\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  Nr. 106 (T44), \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 242\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  Nr. 102 (T42), \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 243\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  Nr. 111 (T46), \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 244\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  Nr. 112 (T47), \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 245\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  Nr. 115 (T48), \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 246\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  Nr. 118 (T48), \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 247\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  Nr. 127 (T53), \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 248\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  Nr. 134 (T58), \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 249\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  Nr. 142 (T62), \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 250\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  Nr. 145 (T63), \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 251\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  Nr. 148 (T64).}

