\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 256\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (162\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Hoc est preceptum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Io 15,12). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Deus precepit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   [decem] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  precepta. Primum est: Non habebis deos alienos coram me. O quanti dampnati sunt pro hoc mandato et multi hodie dampnantur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... Graz, UB, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Ms. 1255}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Nr. 233 (C2). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 257\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (163\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sermo de dedicacione bonus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Cvm episcopus wlt consecrare ecclesiam septem facit. Primum nunccios\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  premittit sic Christus angelos cum tuba: Surgite etc et tunc surgunt omnes illi, qui sunt in inferno et dicent: a a a\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... (C11).}

