\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 258\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (163\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Ego sum pastor bonus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Io 10,14). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Bonitas istius pastoris scilicet Christi in isto ewangelio commendatur in tribus. In pascendo, in defendendo, in cognoscendo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... Graz, UB, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Ms. 1255}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Nr. 67 (T30); ferner \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 259\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  Nr. 99 (T41); \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 260-263\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (164\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  -166\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) mit vier weiteren, nicht in Ms. 1255 \u252 \'fcberlieferten Predigten (Initien s. Initienregister).}

