\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 264\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (166\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Benedicamus patrem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (CAO 6239), s. o., Predigt Nr. 1 (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 265\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (167\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Nota septem leguntur habuisse spiritum sanctum, per quos septem genera hominum intelliguntur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... Nr. 85 (T39); weitere Predigten aus Graz, UB, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Ms. 1255}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 : \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 266\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  Nr. 82 (T36), \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 267\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  105 (T43), \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 268\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  Nr. 120 (T50), \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 269\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  Nr. 79 (T34), \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 270\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  Nr. 70 (T31), \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 276\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  Nr. 124 (T52). \endash  Drei Kirchweih-Predigten: \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 271\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (169\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Domum tuam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Ps 92,5). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Hodie, fratres karissimi, ad templi dedicacionem septem faciendum est, quod triplicem habet domum dominus, unam sanctificatam, alteram sanctificandam, terciam edificandam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... Parallelhs.: Windsheim, StB, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[1].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 83}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , 207\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (C11). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 274\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (172\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Exaudivit dominus de templo sancto\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Ps 17,7). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  In istis verbis ponit dominus deus duo. Primo omni oracioni\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  exaudicionem, ibi \u8218 \'82exaudiuit\u8219 ?. Secundo ponit loci sanctitatem, ibi \u8218 \'82de templo sancto suo\u8219 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... (C11). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 275\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (172\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Venit filius hominis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (vgl. Lc 19,10), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  venit semel ad homines, veniet in die iudicii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... (C11). \endash  Nicht in Graz, UB, Ms. 1255 \u252 \'fcberliefert: \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 272\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (170\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Nota bene\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Preparate corda vestra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (I Sm 7,3). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  In verbis istis Samuel amonet, quod parati simus ad seruandum domino. In quibus quattuor proponuntur, que in debito seruicio requiruntur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... \endash \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 273\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (171\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Franciscus Assisias cf. fund. OFM: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sermo de sancto Francisco\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Induit me dominus vestimento salutis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Is 61,10).\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   Istud uerbum scriptum in Ysaia et bene conuenit beato Francisco, quod dominus noster Ihesus Christus uestiuit quadruplici veste videlicet linea, purpurea, aurea et celita \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ... (S73).}

