\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sitio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (Io 9,28). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Quaedam verba locutus est Iesus Christus in cruce\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Repertorium 8, S. 774, Nr. 124, (6\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Conradus de Brundelsheim\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sermo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  de corpore Christi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Repertorium 1, S. 726, Nr. 122-127, (22\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Egressus Ihesus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (Io 18,1). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Quando hominem deus formare voluit nichil aliud intendebat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... vgl. Augsburg, SuStB, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 2\u176 \'b0 Cod 273}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 75\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , (32\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Repertorium 9, S. 491, Nr. 39, (35\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Repertorium 8, S. 557\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Nr. 61, (37\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Terra ne operias\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (Iob 16,19). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Pretiositas sanguinis Christi in multis consideratur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  habemus accessum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  || Abbruch am Seitenende.
