\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Incipit symbolum Apostolorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Funiculus triplex difficile rumpitur. Funiculus iste quo a terra trahimur ad celum est fides, spes et caritas de quibus est principaliter predicandum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...\endash ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ad sedes sydereas transferuntur. Explicit. Credo dulcis ut medo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Eingeschoben: 6 Hexameter \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Anna solet dici tres concepisse Marias\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Initia 1060. \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Explicit symbolus apostolicum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8249 \'8b. \endash  73\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -74\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
