\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Incipit tractatus de instructione confessorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Simpliciores et minus expertos confessores de modo audiendi confessiones informare cupiens\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ..., (107\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) capitulatio, Text: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Monitiones generales\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Cum aliquis suam confessionem petit audiri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ammonicionibus impulsabis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
