\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De penitentiis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Penitentia dicitur quia pene tentio vel a puniendo quia per illa punit quis illicita commisit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ..., (137\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) de contritione et attritione, (138\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) de confessione, (141\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) de confessionis relatione, (142\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) de satisfactione, (142\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) de oratione, (146\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) de penitentia.
