\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Decastichon eiusdem in laudem Meditatorii Carthusiani\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Aspice vix oritur Dionti Cesaris astrum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   | \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Processit campi gramina iam redeunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Intuitus meminisse juuat heus dulcis Ihesu\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   | \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Duos proles docuit Carthusiana pia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (10 Verse). \endash  (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Ad Libelli auctorem Carmen Eiusdem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Felix viue, pater. Viuat tua fama per orbem}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   | Sedibus ethereis spiratus astra ferat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .}

