\pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  -3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22     {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Registrum}}
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Registrum presentis libri Meditatorii passionis Christi habet Septem partes principales et vnaqueque diuidite in Septem articulos cum speciali de compassionis Virginis Marie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b}

