\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  64\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  -74\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22     {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Instructio religiosae seu perfectae vitae}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Instructio religiose seu perfecte uite\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (64\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  -66\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Palmbaumtraktat: (Prolog) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Ascendam in palmam et apprehendam fructus eius (Ct 7,8). Hiis uerbis ostenditur affectus anime desiderantis fructum perfectionis percipere}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 , quia propterea promittit se uelle opera perfectionis facere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... (Text) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Septem ergo huius palmae gradus sunt siue proprietates uel rami\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  De contemptu mundi et eius causis et signis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Primus gradus est mundi contemptus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  quatenus mereamur in futuro accipere palmam glorie, quam nobis prestare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (66\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  -69\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  De xii observanciis regularibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Uenerunt filii Israel in Helym (Ex 15,27). Hiis uerbis ille uerus Moyses, scilicet Christus uerorum Israelitarum duct}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  or\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  et ad uirtutum palmam peruenitur adiuuante domino\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (69\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  -73\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  De profectu uite spiritualis scilicet quomodo sit pugnandum contra uicia et uirtutibus insistendum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Notandum autem, quod anime fideles cum hiis studuerint disciplinis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... (69\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Uolentibus itaque pugnam istam spiritualem ingredi tria sunt necessaria}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  hec ad presens de pugna dicta sufficiant ad laudem domini nostri Iesu Christi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (73\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  -74\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  De uirtutibus et quomodo digne sint intendum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Omni studio cauendum est, ut cum infrequenti pugna talis homo uirtutibus dicatur}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... (73\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  De castitate\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Prima uirtus istarum est castitas}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 . Tres autem sunt consideraciones causantes ipsam mundiciam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ut in omnibus donis suis deus graciarum actiones recipiat sicut decet, quoniam ipsi debetur honor et gloria in secula seculorum. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Explicit instructio religiose seu perfecte uite\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Parallelhs.: Basel, UB, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 A XI 67}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  -62\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  ; K\u246 \'f6ln, StadtA, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[1].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 GB 8\u176 \'b0 54}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  -45\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . \endash  (1) Parallelhs.: Mainz, StB, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[2].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Hs I 187}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 25\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  -29\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . \endash  B\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 loomfield\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Incipits 488 (diese Hs.); \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bloomfield\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Suppl. 488 (diese Hs.) \endash  Zum Inhalt vgl. Philipp \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Strauch\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Palma contemplationis, in: Beitr\u228 \'e4ge zur Geschichte der deutschen Sprache und Literatur 48 (1924), S. 335-375, ebd. S. 343 Anm. 1, der vorliegende Fassung von der h\u228 \'e4ufig \u252 \'fcberlieferten Allegorisierung des Palmbaums mit jeweils sieben Zweigen, V\u246 \'f6geln und Blumen unterscheidet. \endash  Wolfgang \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Fleischer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Ascendam in palmam. Ein Beitrag zur \u220 \'dcberlieferung der Palmbaumallegorie im Mittelalter, in: Literaturwissenschaftliches Jahrbuch. NF 10 (1969), S. 1-52, ebd. S. 16-20. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Ders\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ., in: \u178 \'b2VL 7 (1989), Sp. 277-287. \endash  (2) Parallelhs.: Mainz, StB, Hs I 187, 29\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  -34\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . \endash  (3) Ebd. 34\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  -59\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   (Textschluss abweichend).}

