\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Versus: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Missam qui dicis post amplexum meretricis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (7 Verse). \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Proverbia 14943a. \endash  Sententiae: \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 1{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Tres cause leguntur infelices}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 . Prima: qui nescit et non interrogat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Rochais\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  /\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Manning\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Nr. 12781. \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Tria sunt, que ducunt hominem ad deum: Cogitacio sancta}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Tria sunt, que seperant\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (89\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  hominem a deo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 : ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  opus prauum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Rochais\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  /\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Manning\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Nr. 12933. \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 3{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Tria sunt, que retinent hominem in bono opere}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Rochais\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  /\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Manning\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Nr. 12958. \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 4{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[6].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Tribus modis securitatem peccandi dyabolus in mentem hominis mittit}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 : Primo suggerit, ut non confiteatur, quia iuuenis est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Per hanc securitatem cum ipse sic deceptus est, dicit: Pax et securitas repentinus ei superueniet interitus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  a quo Christus custodiat. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . Vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Rochais\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  /\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Manning\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Nr. 13012. \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 5{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Te deus elegit: Vas nobile, vas speciale}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Initia 19042. \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 6{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Prespiter, hec cuncta sapienter singula cuncta}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Initia 4523.}

