\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 (67\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Prolog: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \u8250 \'9bReveren\u8249 \'8bdissimi patres et domini. Cogitanti michi ac diligenti crebrius indagine diebus ac noctibus in armario mentis mee\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  pro felici incremento novelle plantationis Illustrum principum dominorum Marchionum Misnensium videlicet alme nostre vniversitatis Lipczensis facere possem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ..., (67\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \u8250 \'9bAlius prologus\u8249 \'8b Ad honorem benedicte et individue trinitatis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quam patronorum huius dyocesis scilicet Sancti Iohannis Baptiste et Sancti Laurencii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ..., (68\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Textbeginn: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \u8250 \'9bCapitulum primum. Sacra Scriptura novem de causis est studenda\u8249 \'8b. \u8250 \'9bQ\u8249 \'8buantum ad primum capitulum dico\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...\endash ... (178\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ut in eternum laudemus eum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (179\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra-va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Capitulatio. Schluss-Schrift: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Finit feliciter amen die veneris vltimo mensis iunii infra horam 7am et 8am anno etc sexagesimo nono\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  178\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   und 179\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   am Rand Notizen \u252 \'fcber eingenommenes Korn (Kursive, 16. Jh.).
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Druck: Hain 6808-6810. \endash  Zur \u220 \'dcberlieferung \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Franz\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Messe, S. 527-530; zum Verfasser vgl. Franz Josef \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Worstbrock\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , in: \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  VL 9 (1995), Sp. 352-355.}

