\uc1
\pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  200\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -207\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24     {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermones de tempore}}
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 (200\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -201\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In octava penthecostes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...\u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Amen amen dico tibi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (Io 3,3). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Notandum primo quod tripliciter est nativitas. Prima est naturalis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  (201\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -202\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In die corporis Christi \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ...\u8249 \'8b Nicolaus de Dinkelspuhel, Sermo de eucharistia, vgl.\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24  Madre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Nikolaus von Dinkelsb\u252 \'fchl, S. 245. Nr. 1. \endash  (202\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -203\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Dominica tertia adventus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...\u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sic nos existimet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (I Cor 4,1). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Cum solempnitas alicuius principis appropinquat ammonentur officiales terre \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \endash  (203\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -204\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In nativitate Christi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...\u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Parvulus enim natus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (Is 9,6). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sicut in Christo sunt due nature scilicet divina et humana\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  (204\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -205\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In natali sancti Stephani\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...\u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Video celos apertos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (Act 7,55). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Pastores heri de quibus dicitur quod fuerunt tres\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... Vgl. Graz, UB, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Ms. 624}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (205\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -206\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Johannes Evangelista\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...\u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Et exaltavit illum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (Ecl 15,4) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Dicit beatus Gregorius: Revertamur, amicos dei, ut eos promissiones\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  (206\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -207\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Dominica infra nativitatem Christi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...\u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Quanto tempore\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (Gal 4,1) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Dicit Fulgencius: In verbis divinis tamquam ditissimus ferculis celestium deliciarum copia spiritualis exuberat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  corrigat et emendat Ihesus Christus in secula benedictus amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \u196 \'c4hnlich Frenswegen, KlosterB, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[1].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Ms. 61}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Sermones f\u252 \'fcr Pfingsoktav, Fronleichnam und Weihnachtszeit, vereinzelt sehr kurze dialektale Erkl\u228 \'e4rungen einzelner Begriffe (190\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 202\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 204\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 rab\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 204\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ).}

