\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx5700\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Domine, exaudi orationem meam, quia iam tempus meum cognosco prope esse}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  te precor, domine, et supplico, ut exaudias deprecacionem meam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (154\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Mit Randglossen und Gebetsanweisungen, dt., 13. Jh., beschnitten: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Daz gvte ge\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [bet] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  soltv gerne\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   [le]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  sen vnd tv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  zv gv\u868 ?te w\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  so mahstv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  genesen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Swer dizze\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   [ge]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  bet lese des\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  bers c\u230 \'e6l\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  da\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  wese\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
