\pard\fi0\li0\tx5700\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  156\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -160\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24     {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Allerheiligenlitanei}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx5700\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx5700\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Kyrie leyson. Christe leyson. Saluator mundi adiuua nos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (156\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -158\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Invocationes, darunter (158\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Benedicte\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Galle\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Magne\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Othmare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Leonharde\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , (158\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Brigida\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (158\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -159\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) F\u252 \'fcrbitten. \endash  (159\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Agnus dei. \endash  (159\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -160\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Preces\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8249 \'8b {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Ego dixi, domine, miserere mei. Sana animam meam, quia peccaui tibi}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Oremus pro omni gradu ecclesie: Sacerdotes tui induantur iusticia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Pro pastore nostro\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Pro rege nostro\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Pro cuncto populo katholico\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Fiat misericordia tua, domine, super nos, quemadmodum sperauimus in te. Domine, exaudi orationem meam et clamor meus ad te ueniat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (Ps 101). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Miserere mei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx5700\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx5700\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Nach \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Klemm\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Romanische Handschriften 2, Kat. 332, S. 225, k\u246 \'f6nnen aus der Allerheiligenlitanei keine Hinweise zur Herkunft des Psalters entnommen werden.}

