\pard\fi0\li0\tx5700\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  160\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -176\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24     {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Orationes}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (160\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Omnipotens deus, sempiterne deus, dirige actus nostros in beneplacito tuo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (CO 3830), mit Randglosse, dt.: [U]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  mbe gvtiv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... [wer?]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ch\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   [der Chri]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  stenheit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (161\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Deus, cui omne cor patet et omnis uoluntas loquitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (CO 1135), mit Glosse: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Dem heilig\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [en] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  geiste vm\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [be rei]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ne gedanc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [ken]. \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Deus, qui karitatis dona per gratiam sancti spiritus tuorum cordibus fidelium infundis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (CO 1483), mit Glosse: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Dem hei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [ligen] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  geiste vm\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [be] ...\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  gende\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Omnipotens sempiterne deus, salus eterna credentium exaudi nos pro infirmis famulis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (CO 4072), mit Glosse: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Vmbe di\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [e] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  sichen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Adesto, domine, supplicacionibus nostris et uiam famulorum famularumque tuarum in salutis tue prosperitatis dispone\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (CO 151), mit Glosse: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Vmbe\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  die\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  der straffe\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (161\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Deus pacis caritatisque amator et custos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (CO 1293), mit Glosse: [V]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  mbe\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  zesam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  hellvg\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (?). \endash  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Presta, quesumus, omnipotens deus, cunctis fidelibus defunctis ueniam}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , uiuentibus indulgentiam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Leroquais\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Livres d\rquote heures 2, S. 107), mit Glosse: [V]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  mbe die sele\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   [di]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  e in no\u868 ?ten\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   [sin]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  t\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx5700\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \par}

