\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx5700\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa60\itap0 (164\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -168\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Z. 5) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Deus summae pacis, et celi sancte pater, omnipotens eterne deus, precor, suscipias animam famule}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  famuli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  tue\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  tui\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  inter sanctos pausantium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  uitamque eternam habere merantur in celis per eum, qui uenturus est iudicare uiuos et mortuos, et seculum per ignem\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf18 .\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \endash  (168\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Z. 5-169\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Commendatio animae: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Com}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 [mendo], }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 d}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 [omine], }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 a}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 [nimam] }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 f}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 [amuli] }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 t}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 [ui] }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 N}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 et animas famulorum famularumque tuarum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   in misericordiam serenissime lucis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  tuam, deus, deposcimus pietatem, ut ei tribuere digneris lucidas et quietas mansiones. Anima eius requiescat in pace. In memoria Christi in uitam eternam commendo illi eam, qui per mortem propriam eam liberauit. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Parallelhs.: Dublin, Trinity College, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 312}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 167\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  -168\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   (100). Vgl. Marvin L. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Colker\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Descriptive Catalogue of the Mediaeval and Renaissance Latin Manuscripts 1. Dublin 1991, S. 633. \endash  Vgl. PL 59, 711D-712D, Anm.}

