\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa60\itap0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Peccaui coram te, domine, peccaui coram sanctis angelis tuis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , fac cum famula tua secundum misericordiam tuam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et efficiar a te de famula amica, fiat in me, domine, uoluntas tua\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  Mit Glosse, beschnitten (172\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Vmbe die\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  de mine\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  de\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
