\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  -4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  In dominica palmarum. Passio domini nostri Iesu Christi. Secundum Mattheum capitulum xxui\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b Mt 26,2-27,61; (4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Hic legitur in tono Euangelii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b Mt 27,62-66. \endash  (4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  -6\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Feria tercia. Passio domini nostri Iesu Cristi. Secundum Marcum capitulum xiiii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b Mc 14,1-15,41; (6\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Hic legitur in tono Euangelii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b Mc 15,42-46. \endash  (6\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  -9\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Feria quarta. Passio domini nostri Iesu Christi. Secundum Lucam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   [capitulum] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  xxii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b Lc 22,1-23,49; (9\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Hic legitur in tono euangelii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b Lc 23,50-53. \endash  (9\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  -11\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Feria ui. Passio super nudum pulpitum dicitur: Passio domini nostri Iesu Christi. Secundum Joannem, xuiii capitulum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b Io 18,1-19,37; (11\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Hic legitur in tono euangelii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b Io 19,38-42.}

