\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Rubrica de reliquiis et Ueneratione Sanctorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \u182 \'b6 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Clemens v papa in concilio Vienensi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . \u182 \'b6 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Festum corporis Christi celebrari debet feria quinta post octauam penthecostes}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   et certe indulgencie conceduntur hiis, qui in festo uel infra octauam officio uel horis intererunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  H\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  [ec] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  d\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  [icit] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Jo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  [annes] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  And\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  [reae]\u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Si dominum in sanctis eius laudare iubemur dignum profecto iustum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  de iniunctis sibi penitenciis relaxamus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
