\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  14\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  -16\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22     {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Johannes Fiscannensis}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Oratio ante missam}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Incipit oracio bona sancti Ambrosii episcopi, que debet legi a quolibet sacerdote ante missam propter magnas indulgencias\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Summe sacerdos et uere pontifex, qui te obtulisti deo patri hostiam puram}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   et immaculatam in ara crucis pro nobis peccatoribus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  neque esuriem neque sitiam in eternum. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Druck: PL 17, 751-755. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Wilmart\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Auteurs spirituels, S. 101-125, Text S. 114-124. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 \endash  Zum Verfasser vgl. LexMA 5 (1991), Sp. 575.}

