\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  17\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  -19\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22     {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Ps.-Birgitta Suecica}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Quindecim orationes de passione domini}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Incipiunt Quindecim Collecte Siue Orationes Illius preclarissime uidue beate Birgitte, quas ante ymaginem domini nostri Ihesu Cristi crucifixi in dies deuotissime dicebat. Tandem ab eodem crucifixo per graciam dignam responsionem habere meruit et ipsa ymago ipsius crucifixi, que in ecclesia Sancti Pauli extat, ipsam beatam Birgittam allocuta fuit. Sequitur prima Oracio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 O domine Ihesu Criste, eterna dulcedo te amancium}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 , iubilus excedens omne gaudium et omne desiderium \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  cum omnibus sanctis tuis in eternum. Amen. Aue dulcissime Ihesu Christe, miserere michi peccatori. Pater noster, Aue Maria etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . \endash  (19\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Schluss-Schrift}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 : \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Finitum feria Quinta ante Thome apostoli Anno domini 1514 per me Bernhart Vennd in augusta Ciuitate ciuitate\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (getilgt: habitat). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Orate pro me\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b. \endash  20\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  -24\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Druck: GW 4362-4383; BSB-Ink B-533-(B-541). \endash  Revelationes caelestes Seraphicae Matris S. Birgittae Suecae, Sponsae Christi Praeelectae, Ordinis Sponsi Sui SS. Salvatoris Fundatricis. Ed. Simon \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 H\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u246 \'f6\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 rmann\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . M\u252 \'fcnchen 1680, S. 748-750. \endash  Claes \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Gejrot\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , The \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  Fifteen Oes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 : Latin and vernacular versions. With an edition of the Latin text, in: Translation, ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Morris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  /\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 O\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \rquote \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Mara\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , S. 213-238, Druck: S. 223-229. \endash  Lit.: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Leroquais\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Livres d\rquote heures 2, S. 98f. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Haimerl\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , S. 74, Anm. 413, S. 92, Anm. 545. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Monta\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 g\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Werk, S. 25-34, ebd. S. 27 mit Hinweis auf die Hs. Budapest, OSzK, Cod. Germ. 16, die wohl von demselben Schreiber \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  Bernardus Wend\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   1509 angefertigt wurde. Vgl. auch John William \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bradley\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , A dictionary of miniaturists, illuminators, calligraphers and copyists. With references to their works, and notices of their patrons \u8230 \'85 3. London 1889, S. 411 sowie Colophons 1, S. 265, Nr. 2116.}

