\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 39\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1    {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Missa in die canonisationis sanctae Birgittae}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Has sequentes collectas legit papa, quando celebrauit missam in die canonizacionis sanncte Birgitte\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8249 \'8b {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Domine Jhesu Criste, qui beatam Birgittam propter multorum secretorum inspiracionem}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Undhagen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 , S. 231 Z. 6-10). \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Secreta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8249 \'8b {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Svscipe, quesumus, domine, preciosa munera, que in beate Birgitta}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  (!), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 sponse tue, sollempnitate deferimus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Undhagen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 , S. 235 Z. 15-18). \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Complenda\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8249 \'8b {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 Saciasti, domine, familiam tuam muneribus sacris}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Undhagen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 , S. 236 Z. 7-10). \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Secundum Lucam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8249 \'8b Lc 11,33. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Et reliqua omelia venerabilis Bede presbyteri: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17\cf1 De se ipso hec dominus loquitur ostendens, ut, si supra dixerit}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 , nullum generacioni nequam nisi signum Yone dandum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 si autem peruersa est intencio, que precedit, prauum est omne, quod sequitur quamuis rectum esse uideatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  (Beda Venerabilis, In Lucae evangelium expositio, lib. 4, c. 11. Druck: PL 92\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , 481D-482B; CC SL 120, S. 239\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  Z. 322-352).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Messe zum Gedenken an die Kanonisation Birgittas am 7. Oktober 1391. Vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Undhagen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 , S. 64, 143f. Zur Heiligsprechung in Rom vgl. auch Bridget \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Morris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 , St Birgitta of Sweden. Woodbridge, Rochester (NY) 1999 (Studies in medieval mysticism 1), S. 149-152.}

