\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Nr. 649. \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In parasceue lectio \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In tribulacione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Post lectionem immediate cantetur tractus et cantetur versus alternatim, similiter tractus sequens\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Domine, audiui auditum tuum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Guerrini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Nr. 654. \endash  (55\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Duo sacerdotes cantetur versus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8249 \'8b V/ \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Popule meus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Duo dyaconi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Agyos otheos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Deinde chorus genua flectendo ad quamlibet clausulam respondeat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sanctus deus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Guerrini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Nr. 655. \endash  (57\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In sabbato sancto\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   pasche. Lectio prima \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In principio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Finita lectione dicatur oracio \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Deus qui mirabiliter\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Lectio ii \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Factum est in vigilia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Post secundam lectionem cantetur Tractus et cantetur uersus alternatinatim\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (!). \pl