\pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  128\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -133\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24     {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Ordinarium missae}}
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In toto duplici et duplici\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8249 \'8b (127\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Kyrie. Zum Textbestand vgl. GR 4*; (127\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -129\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Gloria in excelsis deo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (GR 4*-6*). \endash  (129\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -130\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Credo (vgl. auch GR 55*-57*). \endash  (130\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sanctus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (GR 6*); (130\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Agnus dei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (GR 6*); (130\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ); \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ite, missa est. Deo gracias\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (GR 7*). \endash  (130\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In festis semiduplicibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8249 \'8b \endash  (131\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In dominicis et festis simplicibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8249 \'8b \endash  (132\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Istud Benedicamus dicitur in dominicis diebus de aduentu et in vigilia natalis domini et in festo innocentum, nisi in dominica fuerit, et in dominica in lxx\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   et deinceps in dominicis et in festis semidupplicibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et simplicibus usque ad cenam domini inclusiue. Dicitur eciam in sabbatis, quando de beata uirgine celebratur in predictis temporibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8249 \'8b \endash  (132\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In festis trium lectionum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8249 \'8b \endash  (133\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Predicta \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Kyrie\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , Sanctus et Agnus dei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et Benedicamus dicantur in vigilia beati Andree, nisi in dominica et in octaua eiusdem; in profestis diebus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8249 \'8b \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Quando episcopus celebrat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8249 \'8b \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In missis defunctorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8249 \'8b.
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
