\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 N1: Nr. 1-3. \endash  N2: Nr. 4-6. \endash  N3: Nr. 7; \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Quando omelia legitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8249 \'8b Nr. 8-10. \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In die Natiuitatis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8249 \'8b Nr. 11, 12a. \endash  Benedictiones de BMV. N1: Nr. 13-15. \endash  N2: Nr. 16-18. \endash  N3: Nr. 19; \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Si fuerit omelia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8249 \'8b Nr. 20-21. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In sabbatis dicantur tres ultime, quando de ea fit officium in conuentu.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Vgl. B11.}

