\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (247\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De festis trium lectionum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Guerrini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Nr. 266-270. \endash  (247\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -248\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De festo simplici\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Guerrini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Nr. 271-273. \endash  (248\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De festo semiduplici\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Guerrini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Nr. 274. \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De festo duplici\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8249 \'8b Stark verk\u252 \'fcrzt. Vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Guerrini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Nr. 276; Nr. 278, Satz 2; Nr. 283, Satz 3; Nr. 284. \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De festo toto duplici\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Guerrini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Nr. 285-289. \endash  (248\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb-vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De octauis sanctorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Guerrini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Nr. 295-296. \endash  (248\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De memoriis faciendis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Guerrini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Nr. 297-301. \endash  (249\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb-va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De ordine memoriarum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Guerrini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Nr. 302. \endash  (249\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De festis extra ordinem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Guerrini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Nr. 303 (verk\u252 \'fcrzt). \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De materiis sero post completorium dicendis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Guerrini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Nr. 304. \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De orationibus et uigiliis sanctorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Guerrini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Nr. 305.}

