\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 De apostolis (C2). \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Guerrini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Nr. 454. \endash  (338\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rab\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) De evangelista (C3). \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Guerrini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Nr. 455. \endash  (338\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -339\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) De uno martyre (C4). \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Guerrini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Nr. 456. \endash  (339\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -341\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) De pluribus martyribus (C5). \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Guerrini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Nr. 457. \endash  (341\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -343\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) De uno confessore (C6). \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Guerrini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Nr. 458. \endash  (343\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -344\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) De una virgine (C8). \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Guerrini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Nr. 459. \endash  (344\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vab\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) In communi sanctorum trium lectionum extra tempus paschale. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Guerrini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Nr. 460. \endash  (344\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -345\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Ad faciendam memoriam. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Guerrini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Nr. 461. \endash  (345\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vab\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Ad memoriam beati Dominici cf. fund. OP. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Guerrini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Nr. 462-463.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De communi sanctorum lectiones\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8249 \'8b (345\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Notandum quod lectiones infra scripte de communi sanctorum ad hoc sunt facte prolixe\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  nisi de communi sanctorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (345\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -346\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In festo vnius vel plurimorum apostolorum quando ix lectiones fiunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8249 \'8b \endash  (346\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -348\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Lect. 1-9. \endash  (348\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -350\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In festo ewangelistarum, quando ix lectiones fiunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8249 \'8b \endash  (350\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -351\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Item de quo supra, quando tres lectiones fiunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8249 \'8b \endash  (351\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -354\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Vnius martyris, quando ix lectiones sunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8249 \'8b \endash  (354\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra-vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Vnius martiris trium lectionum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8249 \'8b \endash  (354\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -357\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Plurimorum martyrum, quando ix lectiones fiunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8249 \'8b \endash  (357\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -358\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Plurimorum martyrum iii lectiones\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8249 \'8b \endash  (358\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -361\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Vnius confessoris pontificis, quando ix lectiones fiunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8249 \'8b \endash  (361\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -362\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Vnius confessoris et pontificis trium lectionum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8249 \'8b \endash  (362\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -364\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Vnius confessoris non pontificis, quando nouem lectiones fiunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8249 \'8b \endash  (364\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -365\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Vnius confessoris non pontificis trium lectionum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8249 \'8b \endash  (365\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -368\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Vnius confessoris doctoris, quando ix lectiones fiunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8249 \'8b \endash  (368\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -370\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Vnius confessoris doctoris trium lectionum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8249 \'8b \endash  (370\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -372\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Vnius virginis et martyris, quando ix lectiones fiunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8249 \'8b \endash  (372\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -373\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In festo vnius virginis et martyris trium lectionum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8249 \'8b \endash  (373\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -376\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Vnius virginis non martyris, si fiant ix lectiones\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8249 \'8b \endash  (376\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -377\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Vnius virginis non martyris trium lectionum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8249 \'8b.}

