\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  380\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -381\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24     {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Officium defunctorum}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sciendum quod pro defunctis semper faciende vigilie nouem lectionum a fratribus in conuentu\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  in uigilia autem trium lectionum dicatur: prima \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8218 \'82\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Deus venie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8219 ?\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , secunda \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8218 \'82\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Deus quo nos patrem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8219 ?\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , tercia \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8218 \'82\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Fidelium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8219 ?. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Guerrini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Nr. 477-479. \endash  (380\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Orationes de officio defunctorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8249 \'8b Mit den Gebeten CO 1757b, \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Pro uiro defuncto\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8249 \'8b CO 3116b, (381\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Pro femina\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8249 \'8b CO 4843, \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In anniuersario\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8249 \'8b vgl. CO 1251, \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Pro fratribus familiaribus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8249 \'8b CO 2205, (381\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Pro parentibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8249 \'8b CO 1903, \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Pro omnibus fidelibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8249 \'8b CO 2684b.}

