\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 ||Hym. [Tristes erant] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  apostoli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   | \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De nece sui domini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (AH 51 Nr. 84, Str. 5). \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ad laudes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8249 \'8b Hym. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sermone blando \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (AH 51 Nr. 84 Str. 6-11); V/ \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Gauisi sunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (CAO 8080). \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Von sand Marien\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8249 \'8b MAT: Or. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 O beata Maria, quis tibi dingne (!) ualeat mira graciarum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Barr\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 \u233 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S. 41); (I\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) R/ \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Cum esset rex\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (Cantus 602574); RV/ \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Pulcra sum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (vgl. Cantus 602574a). \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Iube\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   [domine benedicere]\u8249 \'8b Or. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Admitte piissima dei genitrix}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   Maria nostras preces\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Barr\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 \u233 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S. 41f.); R/ \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ave Maria\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (CAO 6155); RV/ \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Benedicta tu\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (CAO 6155z). \endash  Or. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sancta Maria succurre miseris}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Barr\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 \u233 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S. 41f.);\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  R/ \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Virgo parens\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; RV/ \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Intercede pia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Dirks\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , in: AFP 53, S. 73; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Chev\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . 21842); \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ant.B/ \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Aue stella matutina\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (AH 48\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Nr.\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 261). \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Paschali tempore. In laudis antiphona\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b Ant. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Beata dei genitrix\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (CAO 1563)|| (Textabbruch).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Fragment eines Marienoffiziums, wohl 1. H\u228 \'e4lfte 15. Jh. Vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Guerrini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   Nr. 464; ferner B6 sowie Jean \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Leclercq\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Formes anciennes de l\rquote office Marial, in: Ephemerides liturgicae 74 (1960), S. 89-102, bes. S. 92-94.}

