\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (Z. 8-19) Or. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Ad letha (!) dei fortissime Christi martir Christofere}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , qui secutus dominum protulisti martirum nos in hac valle lacrimarum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...; Or. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Presta, quesumus, omnipotens deus, ut, sicud beati Christoferi martiris tui natalicia celebramus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (CO 4559c); Hym. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  O quam miranda est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (vgl. AH 25 Nr. 5). \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Corona super capud eius expressa ignis sanctitatis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
