\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (231\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Z. 14) Von j\u252 \'fcngerer, wohl aus Altenhohenau stammender Hand Nachtrag weiterer F\u252 \'fcrbitten: Or. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Omnipotens sempiterne deus, da nobis fidei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (CO 3819), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Dominica xiiii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; Or. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Custodi, domine, quesumus, ecclesiam tuam propiciacione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (CO 875), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Dominica xv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; (231\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Or. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ecclesiam tuam, domine, miseratio continuata mundet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (CO 2418) [Dom. x]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  vi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; Or. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Tua nos, quesumus domine, gratia semper et preueniat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (CO 5956), [Dom. x]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  vii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; Or. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Da, quesumus, domine, populo tuo diabolica uitare contagia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (CO 990), [Dom. x]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  viii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; Or. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Dirigat corda nostra, domine tue miseracionis operacio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (CO 2234), [Dom. x]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  viiii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; Or. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Omnipotens et misericors deus, uniuersa, nobis aduersancia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (CO 3773), [Dom. x]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  x\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; Or. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Largire, quesumus, domine, fidelibus tuis indulgenciam \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (CO 3237), [Dom. x]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  xi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; Or. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Familiam tuam, quesumus, domine, continua pietate custodi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (CO 2637\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ), \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [Dom. x]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  xii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; Or. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Deus, refugium nostrum et uirtus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (CO 2175). \endash  Fortsetzung der Gebete auf 244\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (s. u.)}

