\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  In die cinerum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \endash  (85\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  -87\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Filia populi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Filia populi mei induere cilicio ... (Ier 6,26). Quamuis sollempnitas quadragesimales in sequenti dominica inchoetur}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 , ecclesia tamen hos quatuor dies precedentes addicit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ideo peccator debet plangere et dicere: Miserere mei deus, quoniam conculcauit me homo etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Ps 55,2). Vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Repertorium 2, S. 238, Nr. 196. \endash  Weitere Predigten, z. T. mit abweichendem Textschluss: Nr. 198, 200, 202, 204, 206 (expl. 94\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 : ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  qui ipsum totum combureret et ideo non restat, nisi ut inferius in fornace cadat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .) \endash  Nr. 208, 210, 212, 214, 216, 218, 220, 222, 224, 226, 227, 229, 231, 233, 235, 237, 239, 241, 243, 245, 247, 249, 251, 253, 255, 257, 259, 261, 263, 265, 267, 269, 271, 273, 275, 277, 279, 281, 283, 285, 287, 289, 292. \endash  (179\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Schluss-Schrift: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5686/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Explicit Jacobus de uoragine per manus domini Chunradi Clauigeri sub anno domini M\u176 \'b0 CCC\u176 \'b0 lxxx nono}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .
