\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Dominica inuitatorium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8249 \'8b {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Trinum deum et vnum pronis mentibus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85, (15\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Montag inuitatorium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8249 \'8b, (29\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Eritag invitatorium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8249 \'8b, (45\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Mitwoch invitatorium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8249 \'8b, (67\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Pfintztag inuitatorium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8249 \'8b, (75\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Freytag inuitatorium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8249 \'8b, (98\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sambstag inuitatorium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8249 \'8b. Capitula und Collectae h\u228 \'e4ufig \u252 \'fcbersprungen und an den Schlu\u223 \'df gestellt, (115\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   in omni die per totum annum, 117\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   in festivis BMV). \endash  (118\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) dominica oratio, Ave Maria, Credo, Salve regina. (119\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Nachtrag: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  das lob am Afftermontag\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Speciosa facta es\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (CAO 4988), {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Schreibervermerk}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Anno domini 1522\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8249 \'8b. \endash  Eingelegte Zettel: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Chevalier\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   20016 mit Notation; Fragment einer Allerheiligenlitanei.
