\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (8\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Pater noster; Ave Maria; Credo. \endash \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24  Hora matutina et Laudes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : (8\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -9\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Invitatorien zur MAT f\u252 \'fcr Dom. 1 in Adv: Inv. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ecce uenit rex\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (CAO 1074); Dom. 2: Inv. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Rex noster adueniet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (CAO 1155); Dom. 3: Inv. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Surgite uigilemus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (CAO 1165); (9\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Dom. 4: Inv. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ecce iam uenit plenitudo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (CAO 1073); Vig. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Nat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : Inv. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Hodie scietis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (CAO 1084); \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Nat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : Inv. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Christus natus est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (CAO 1055); Dom. in \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Lxx\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : Inv. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Preoccupemus faciem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (CAO 1115); Dom. 1 in \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Xl\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : Inv. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Non sit uobis uanum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (CAO 1110); Dom. 2: Inv. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Quoniam deus magnus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (CAO 1124); Dom. 3: Inv. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ploremus coram domino\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (Cantus 100210); Dom. 4: Inv. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Populus domini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (CAO 1113); Dom. in \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Pass\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : Inv. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Hodie si uocem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (CAO 1085); (9\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Dom. in ramis palmar