\pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Auslegung (zu Sap. 8,19-20).  \endash   (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Vers: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Corbinianus cor binum gerens, crementa ferens gemine charitatis / Terre mandata seruans pignora beata, stat Frisingia laureata\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -14\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Arbeo Frisingensis}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  ]: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Vita Corbiniani}}
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Prologus in vitam beati Corbiniani episcopi et confessoris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Cum cupimus ad edificacionem audiencium beati Corbiniani vitam stilo breuissimo explicare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85, \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Incipit tabula registri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8249 \'8b \u8230 \'85, (3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Incipit vita S. Corbiniani U\u8249 \'8benerandus igitur dei famulus Corbinianus ortus fuerat ex regione Melitonensi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85-\u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  opem confert iugiter sanitatis, praestante\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Laus deo pax viuis requiesq/ defunctis Amen. Anno salutis etc. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [14]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  99\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8249 \'8b. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Presens legenda est Marci Holtzner presbiteri capellani diui Christophori Landesute\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (!).
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Kurzfassung nach Arbeo (BHL 1948), Fassung B mit Einteilung in 47 Kapitel. \-\endash  Ed.: MGH SS Rerum Merovingicaum 6, S. 594-635: zur Hs. (Nr. 9\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 e)\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) S. 550. }

