\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Dicta Hainrici de Frimaria super epistulas et ewangelia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[7].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Scientes quia hora ... (Rm 13,11). In ewangelio annunciatur nobis adventum }}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 magni regum regis inquam pauperis et ascendentis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ..., (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Induamur arma ... (Rm 13,12). Vexillarius principis in proelio existens ex officio suo tenetur}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ..., (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Dicite filie Syon ... (Mt 21,5). In ista auctoritate duo innuuntur. Primum est persona}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ...\endash ... (73\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Hic est vere ... (Io 6,14). Consuetudo pauperum et humilium est quod benefactores}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ...\endash ... (74\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 premium totaliter retribuere domino. Qui cum patre ... Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  Eingeschoben sind 5 weitere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  nicht bei Schneyer verzeichnete Predigten: (4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) T1 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[8].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Sic nos existimet ... (I Cor 4,1). Cum magna sollicitudine aliquis pauper artem addiscit}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... auch Stams, StiftsB, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 26}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 , 7\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  (4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) T3 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Ecce ego mitto ... (Mal 3,1). Moraliter in ista auctoritate innuitur adventus domini}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... auch Stams, StiftsB, 26,7\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  (7\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) T10 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[6].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Nolite conformari ... (Rm 12,2). Nota fidelis pedagogus puerum sibi commissum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... auch Stams, StiftsB, 26, 14\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  und W\u252 \'fcrzburg, UB, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[1].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 M. p. th. q. 58}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 , 99\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  (21\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) T23 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Hoc sentite ... (Phil 2,5). Duo hic notantur circa Christum, scilicet dignatio et premium}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ... \endash  (27\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Lignum vite ... (Apc 22,14). Sunt XII secula que Jesus Christus transiens ministrat}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ...
