\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Incipiunt adaptaciones. De Abstinentia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8249 \'8b. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Duplex est abstinentia: detestabilis et laudabilis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...\endash ... \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De eterna vita\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8249 \'8b ...  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  permittuntur in celo. Ad quos perducere dignetur qui vivit et regnat in secula seculorum et dicit omnis populus Amen. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (307\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Incipiunt adaptaciones omnium sermonum in hoc libello contentorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... Kapitelverzeichnis, endet kurz vor Schluss (in exaltatione sancte Crucis).
