\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Frater Bonaventura\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8249 \'8b {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Simile est regnum ... (Mt 13,24). Detinebant illum ... (Lc 4,32). Istud verbum ultimum scribitur Luce}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   XIIII\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (!), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ubi notandum quod inter omnia officia ierarchica nobilissimum officium est evangelizare regnum dei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  a quo supplicio nos liberatos perducat filius dei ad regnum celorum. Quod nobis prestare dignetur etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Balduinus \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Distelbrink\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Bonaventurae scripta authentica dubia vel spuria critice recensita (Subsidia scientifica franciscalia 5), Rom 1975, S. 81, Nr. 56/3. \endash  Pal\u233 \'e9mon \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Glorieux,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   R\u233 \'e9pertoire des Ma\u238 \'eetres en th\u233 \'e9ologie de Paris au XIII\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 e\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   si\u232 \'e8cle Bd. 2 (\u201 \'c9tudes de Philosophie M\u233 \'e9di\u233 \'e9vale 18), Paris 1934, Nr. 305y. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Repertorium 1, S. 626, Nr. 476. \endash  Ed.: Bonaventura, Op. om. 5, S. 539-553; zur \u220 \'dcberlieferung ebd. S. XLVf. (ohne diese Hs.)}

