\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 De resurrectione domini: Hym. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sermone blando angelus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (AH 51 Nr. 84 Str. 6-11; Nr. 83 Str. 7); (173\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) V/ \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Gauisi sunt dyscipuli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (CAO 8080)\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Asc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : Hym. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Tu, Christe, nostrum gaudium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (AH 51 Nr. 88 Str. 5-7; Nr. 89 Str. 5); (174\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) V/ \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  A summo celi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (CAO 7320b). \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Pent\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : MAT mit Hym. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Iam Christus asstra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ascenderat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (AH 51 Nr. 92 Str. 1-4; Nr. 91 Str. 6-7); (175\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) LAUD: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Der ymnus czu der laudes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8249 \'8b Hym. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Inpleta gaudent viscera\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (AH 51 Nr. 92 Str. 5-8; Nr. 91 Str. 6-7); (175\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) V/ \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Spiritus paraclitus alleluia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (CAO 8205). \endash  Corpus Christi: MAT mit Hym. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sacris solemnis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (AH 50 Nr. 387); (177\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) LAUD mit Hym. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Uerbum supernum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (AH 50 Nr. 388); V/ \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Posuit fines tuos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (Cantus 800347); (178\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Ant. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sapientia ediuicauit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (Cantus 204549), Ant. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Angelorum esca\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (Cantus 200280), Ant. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Pingwuis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  est panis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (Cantus 203845), Ant. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Uincenti dabo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (Cantus 205202), Ant. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ego sum panis vivus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (CAO 2595). Vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Lambot\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , L\rquote office de la F\u234 \'eate-Dieu, S. 95, 96.
