\pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  43\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  -60\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22     {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Bonifatius IX. Papa}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Bulla canonizationis beatae Birgittae}}
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sequitur bulla Canonizacionis beate Birgitte de regno Swecie gloriose sponse Christi, quam dedit Bonifacius papa nonus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Bonifacius episcopus seruus seruorum dei ... salutem et apostolicam benedictionem. Ab origine mundi post primi parentis lapsum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  datum Rome apud sanctum Petrum nonas Octobris pontificatus nostri anno secundo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Rom, 7. Oktober 1391).
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  BHL 1346; BHL Nov. Suppl. 1346. \endash  Druck: AS, Oct. IV, S. 468-472, Nr. 413-432. \endash  Vgl. auch Isak \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Collijn\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , En Birgitta-Handskrift fr\u229 \'e5n Klostret Maria Maihingen, in: Donum Grapeanum. Festskrift till\u228 \'e4gnad \u214 \'d6verbibliotekarien Anders Grape p\u229 \'e5 Sextiofem\u229 \'e5rsdagen den 7 Mars 1945. Uppsala 1945 (Acta Bibliothecae Regiae Universitatis Upsaliensis 5), S. 8-14, ebd. S. 14. \endash  Von j\u252 \'fcngerer Hand Einteilung der Bulle in lectiones: (43\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  -46\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) lectiones 1-6, (46\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  -49\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  legenda sancte Birgitte\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , lectiones 1-6, (50\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  -51\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) lectiones 1-3, (52\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  -54\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  in natali beate Birgitte\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , lectiones 1-6, (53\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) rot, radiert: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  finis lectionum uel alie lectiones\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  octauum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   (?) ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  eius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , (54\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  Tu autem. Finis huius lectionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 .}

