\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sequitur confirmacio Canonizacionis beate Birgitte per Martinum papam quintum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Martinus episcopus seruus seruorum dei}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 ... {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Excellentum principum, deo presertim et Romane ecclesie deuotorum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 , desideriis libenter annuimus, illaque, precipue cum ad orthodoxe fidei consolidacionem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  cedere dinoscuntur, fauoribus prosequimur opportunis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  datum Florencie kalendas Julii pontificatus nostri anno secundo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (Florenz, 1. Juli 1419). \endash  63\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  -71\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   leer.
