\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Aspersiones: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Ad aspersionem aque benedicte. Antiphona\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b Ant. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Asperges me\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (GR 1*). \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Guerrini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   Nr. 569. \endash  (III\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  De aspersione aque benedicte tempore paschali antiphona\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b Ant. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Uidi aquam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (GR 2*); (IV\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  In die pasche\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b All V/ \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Hec est dies\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (vgl. GR 219); (IV\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  In residuo tempore\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b All V/ \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Confitemini domino\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (vgl. GR 199); \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  In die pentecosten\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b All V/ \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Emitte spiritum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (GR 249). Vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Guerrini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   Nr. 570.}

