\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\tqc\tx4530\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (8\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Hym. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Benedictus es, domine deus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ; \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Chorus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b R/ \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Et laudabilis et gloriosus in secula\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . \endash  V/ \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Et benedictum nomen glorie tue\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ; (8\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Chorus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b R/ \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Et laudabilis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . \endash  V/ \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Benedictus es in templo sancto\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ; \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Chorus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b R/ \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Et laudabilis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . \endash  V/ \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Benedictus es super thronum sanctum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ; (9\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Chorus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b R/ \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Et laudabilis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . \endash  V/ \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Benedictus es, qui ambulas super pennas uentorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ; R/ \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Et laudabilis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . \endash  V/ \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Benedictus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (9\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  es, qui sedes super Cherubin intuens abyssos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ; R/ \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Et laudabilis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . \endash  V/ \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Benedicant te omnes angeli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ; R/ \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Laudabilem et gloriosum in secula\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Benedicant te celi,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (10\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  terra, mare et omnia, que in eis sunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ; R/ \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Laudabilis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . \endash  V/ \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Gloria patri et filio et spiritui sancto\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ; R/ \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Laudabili et glorioso in secula\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . \endash  V/ \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sicut erat in principio et nunc et semper\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (10\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  et in secula seculorum. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (vgl. GR 15-18); R/ \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Et laus et honor, potestas et imperium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . \endash  V/ \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Benedictus es\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ; \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Chorus. Responsorium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b R/ \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Domine deus pa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  [ter]. \endash  Tract. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Laudate dominum omnes gentes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (GR 91f.) \endash  R/ \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Letatus sum in hiis, que dicta sunt michi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . \endash  V/ \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Fiat pax in uirtute tua\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ; (12\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) R/ \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Oculi omnium in te sperant, domine\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . \endash  (12\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) V/ \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Aperies tu manum tuam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .}

