\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Letania festum incipiatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b: (71\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  -74\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Invocationes: (73\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Hic uox exaltetur et bis cantetur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b Dominicus, mit zwei Anrufungen; Thomas de Aquino; Vincentius Ferrerius; Franciscus Assisias cf. fund. OFM; (74\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Rupertus ep. Salisburgensis; Virgilius ep. Salisburgensis; (74\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Catharina v. m., zwei Anrufungen; (74\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Elisabeth vid. lantgravia Thuringiae. \endash  (75\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  -80\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Deprecationes: Nr. 1-3; (75\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Nachtrag im Fu\u223 \'dfsteg von der Hand der Anna Zinerin: Nr. 4; 5-24; (78\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) desgleichen: Nr. 25; 26-34; (80\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) desgleichen: Nr. 35; 36-39. \endash  (80\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  -81\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Agnus dei: Nr. 40-43. Zu den F\u252 \'fcrbitten vgl. B13. \endash  (81\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Finita letania cantor alta uoce incipiat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Kyrie eleyson\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Gloria in excelsis deo et in terra. Alleluia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . \endash  (81\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) All V/ \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Confitemini domino\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (GR 199); (83\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Tract. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Laudate dominum omnes gentes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (GR 199f.); (83\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sicut in Sabbato sancto\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  Offic. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Emitte spiritum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (GR 249); (84\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Comm. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Ultimo festiuitatis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (GR 247). Vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Guerrini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   Nr. 685.
