\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  In festis totum duplicibus et duplicibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b (154\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Kyrie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . Zum Textbestand vgl. GR 4*; (154\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  -156\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Gloria in excelsis deo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (vgl. GR 4*-6*). \endash  (156\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  -158\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Credo (vgl. auch GR 55*-57*). \endash  (158\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sanctus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (vgl. GR 6*); (159\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Agnus dei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (vgl. GR 6*); (160\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Ite, missa est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Deo gracias\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (vgl. GR 7*). \endash  (160\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  In festis semiduplicibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \endash  (163\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  In dominicis et festis simplicibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \endash  (166\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Istud sequens \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8218 \'82\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Benedicamus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8219 ?\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   dicitur in dominicis de aduentu et in uigilia natalis domini et in festo innocencium, nisi dominica fuerit, et dominica in septuagesima et deinceps in dominicis et in festis semiduplicibus et simplicibus usque ad cenam domini inclusiue. Dicitur eciam in sabbatis, quando de beata uirgine celebratur missa in predictis temporibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Benedicamus domino deo gratias\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  In missis matutinalibus et infra octauas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \endash  (168\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  In festis trium leccionum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \endash  (168\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Predicta \u8218 \'82Kyrieleyson\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8219 ?\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   et \u8218 \'82Sanctus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8219 ?\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   et \u8218 \'82Agnus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8219 ?\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   et \u8218 \'82Benedicamus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8219 ?\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   dicantur in uigilia beati Andree, quando in dominica contingit et in octaua eiusdem et in profestis diebus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \endash  (169\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Quando episcopus celebrat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \endash  (170\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  In missis defunctorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b.
