\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\tx5940\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  In natiuitae domini et duobus diebus sequentibus et in epyphania et in purificacione. Sequencia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Letabundus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   | \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Exultet fidelis chorus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   | \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Alleluia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (AH 54 Nr. 2). \endash  (172\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Pasc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Uictime paschali laudes immolent christiani\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (AH 54 Nr. 7). \endash  (174\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Asc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Omnes gentes, plaudite\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (AH 54 Nr. 152). \endash  (177\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Pent\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sancti spiritus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   | \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Assit nobis gracia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (AH 54 Nr. 70). \endash  (180\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  In duobus sequentibus diebus post diem pentecostes sequencia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Ueni, sancte spiritus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (AH 54 Nr. 153). \endash  (182\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Tri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Profitentes unitatem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   | \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Ueneremur trinitatem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (AH 54 Nr. 161). \endash  (185\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Corpus Christi: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Lauda Syon saluatorem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (AH 50 Nr. 385). \endash  (191\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Dedicatio ecclesiae: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Rex Salomon fecit templum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (AH 55 Nr. 31). \endash  (194\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Schluss-Schrift:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   Finitus liber iste Anno domini M\u176 \'b0 cccc\u176 \'b0 lxxviii in uigilia sancti Thome de Aquino ordinis predicatorum ad laudem et gloriam sancte et indiuidue trinitatis patris et filii et spiritus sancti. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . Von C\lquote  in kleinerem Schriftgrad: [Per] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  sororem Annam Zinerin huius monasterii priorissam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .}

