h  (91\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  In parasceue lectio \u8250 \'9bIn tribulacione\u8249 \'8b. Post lectionem inmediate cantetur tractus et cantetur versus alternatim similiter tractus sequentes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 : Tract. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Domine, audiui auditum tuum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (GR 177f.); (92\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Tract. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Eripe me, domine\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (GR 178-181). \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Guerrini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   Nr. 654. \endash  (94\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Duo sacerdotes cantent versus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b V/ \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Popule\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ; \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Duo dyaconi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Agyos o theus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Guerrini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   Nr. 655. \endash  (97\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) In Sabb. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Pasc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 :\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Lectio prima \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  In principio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 . Finita lectione dicatur \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Eternum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 . Oracio \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Deus, qui mirabiliter\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 . Lectio ii \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Factum est in uigilia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 . Post secundam lectionem cantetur Responsorium et cantentur versus alternatim. Et similiter duorum sequencium tractatuum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Guerrini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   Nr. 662. \endash  (99\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  -105\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Letania statim incipiatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b (99\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  -101\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Invocationes, Nachtrag von Hand des 15. Jhs., wohl aus Altenhohenau: (99\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sancta Maria\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ; (101\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Hic uox exaltetur et bis cantetur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b Aufgef\u252 \'fchrt werden u. a.: Dominicus cf. fund. OP, Franciscus Assisias cf. fund. OFM, Hieronymus, Benedictus Anianus. Von derselben Hand wie auf 99\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   wurden nachgetragen: (101\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sancte Thome, Sancte Vincenti, Sancte Bernharde, Sancte Ruperte, Sancte Virgili, Sancta Anna, Sancta Martha\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . \endash  (102\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  -104\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Deprecationes: Nr. 1, 2 (Nachtrag von der Hand wie auf 99\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ), Nr. 3, 5-24, 26-34, 36-39. \endash  (104\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  -105\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Agnus dei: Nr. 40-42. Zu den F\u252 \'fcrbitten vgl. B13; Abdruck auch bei \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Wagn\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 er\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Einf\u252 \'fchrung 3, S. 262. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \endash  (105\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Finita letania cantor alta uoce incipiat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Kyrie eleyson\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ... (105\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Gloria in excelsis deo et in terra pax. Alleluia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ; All \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 V/ \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Confitemini domino\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  (\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  GR 199\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ); (105\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 ) \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Tractus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Laudate dominum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (GR 199f.); \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Ad Magnificat antiphona\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b Ant.M \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Uespere autem sabbati\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (CAO 5371). Vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Guerrini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   Nr. 663-664. \endash  (105\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Pasc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . G\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 uerrini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   Nr. 665. \endash  (107\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) f2-Sabb. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Guerrini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   Nr. 666-671. \endash  (115\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Dom. in oct. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Pasc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Guerrini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   Nr. 673. \endash  (115\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Dom. 1 post oct. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Pasc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Guerrini\plain \f1\lan