\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 De apostolis (C2). \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Guerrini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   Nr. 873. \endash  (197\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) De uno martyre (C4). \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Guerrini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   Nr. 875. \endash  (201\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) De pluribus martyribus (C5). \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Guerrini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   Nr. 876. \endash  (209\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) De uno confessore (C6). \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Guerrini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   Nr. 877. \endash  (215\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) De una virgine (C8). \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Guerrini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   Nr. 878.
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (222\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  De spiritu sancto\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Guerrini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   Nr. 880. \endash  (222\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  De sancta cruce\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Guerrini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   Nr. 881. \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  In commemoracione beate virginis in aduentu domini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Guerrini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   Nr. 882. \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  A natiuitate domini usque ad purificationem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b G\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 uerrini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   Nr. 883. \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  A purificacione usque ad aduentum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Guerrini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   Nr. 884 mit den Zus\u228 \'e4tzen: (223\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Kyrie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (GR 4*); (223\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Gloria in excelsis deo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (GR 4*-6*); (225\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sanctus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (GR 6*); (225\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Agnus dei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (GR 6*); (226\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Ite, missa est. Deo gracias\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Pro quacumque necessitate. Officium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Salus populi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . G\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 uerrini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   Nr. 886.}

