\pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  226\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -235\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24     {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Ordinarium missae}}
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  In toto duplici et duplici\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Kyrie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (GR 4*); \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Gloria in excelsis deo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (GR 4*-6*). \endash  (227\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  -229\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Credo (vgl. auch GR 55*-57*). \endash  (229\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sanctus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (GR 6*); \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Agnus dei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . (GR 6*); (229\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Ite, missa est. Deo gracias\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (GR 7*). \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  In festis semiduplicibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \endash  (231\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  In dominicis et festis simplicibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \endash  (232\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Istud Benedicamus dicitur in dominicis de aduentu et in vigilia natalis domini et in festo innocentum, nisi dominica fuerit, et in dominica in lxx\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   et deinceps in dominicis et in festis semidupplicibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  et simplicibus usque ad cenam domini inclusiue. Dicitur eciam in sabbatis, quando de beata uirgine celebratur in predictis temporibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \endash  (234\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  In festis trium lectionum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Predicta Kyrie, Sanctus et Agnus dei et Benedicamus dicantur in vigilia beati Andree, in dominica et in octaua eiusdem, in profestis diebus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \endash  (235\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Quando episcopus celebrat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  In missis defunctorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \endash  236\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   leer.
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Sigl, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Geschichte, S. 12 (Nr. 10), 19, 30, 35, 37 (diese Hs.)}

