\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Stephanus pp. m. (2.8.): Or. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Deus, qui nos beati Stephani martyris tui atque pontificis annua sollempnitate letificas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (CO 1869).
