\pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  15\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -37\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24     {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Johannes de Deo}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Liber poenitentiarius}}
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Summa Iohannis de Deo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8249 \'8b. Prolog: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Venerabili patri ac domino L divina providentia Bononiensi episcopo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (16\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Text: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sic tene quod subtiliter et astute debes ab infirmis requirere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...\endash ... (37\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Iste sunt bases et collumpne que in vitam hominem ad penitentiam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et defendunt a peccatis et sustineant in vera penitentia. Ad quam nos perducit qui vivit et regnat etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Prolog mit Widmung an den Bischof von Bologna. \endash  Teildruck: PL 99, 1085-1108. \endash  Antonio Domingues \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 de Sousa Costa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Um mestre portugues ..., Braga 1957, S. 115-124 (Hs. genannt). \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Michaud-Quantin\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Sommes, S. 26f. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Diaz y Diaz\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Nr. 1275. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bloomfield\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Inicipits 6358, 5690. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schulte,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   GQ 2, S. 102 mit Anm. 24 (Hs. genannt).
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 37\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Nota peccata IIIIor modis distinguntur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... vgl. N\u252 \'fcrnberg, GNM, Hs 17a, 170\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .}

