\pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  37\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -40a\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24     {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Johannes de Deo}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Liber dispensationum}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  (Ausz\u252 \'fcge)}}
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De divina dispensatione de genere humano\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8249 \'8b Prolog: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Nota de dispensatione primo videndum est de divina dispensatione cum humano genere a principio mundi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (37\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Venerabilibus viris fratribus predicatoribus et fratribus minoribus et heremitis scolaribus dominis magistris Bon\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [oniae] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  commorantibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Magister Iohannes de Deo Yspanus doctor decretorum salutem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  sit interdictum vel accusatione non permissum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Text: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Tene quod dispensatio est iuris relaxatio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De dispensatione divina. Nec mirum si homines dispensant cum hominibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...\endash ... (40a\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  uni parti possit gratificare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  in talibus. LXIII c. ult.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (D. 63 c. 36)
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Text insbesondere im 1. Teil verk\u252 \'fcrzt. Zum Werk: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 de Sousa Costa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   (s. o.), S. 97-105. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Ders,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   in: Revista portugesa de Historia 13 (1971), S. 269-297. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Diaz y Diaz,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   Nr. 1269. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schulte\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , GQ 2, S. 96f. (Prolog abgedruckt).}

