\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sancte Dorothee\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8249 \'8b Or. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Omnipotens sempiterne deus, in cuius nomine gloriosa uirgo et mater Dorothea multorum genera tormentorum superauit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ut eius meritis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  || Textabbruch. (Parallelhs.: Ebstorf, KlosterB, IV 5, 251\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). \endash  (275\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Von Nachtragshand 1: Or. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Deus, gloria uirginum et amator eorum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , qui beate Ursule in palma martirii contulisti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  Rest der Seite leer. \endash  275\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -277\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Eingelegte Bl\u228 \'e4tter:
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Zwischen 19 und 20: Doppelbl., 21,5 \u215 \'d7 15, Papier, Wasserzeichen Ochsenkopf mit Augen und Stange, beschnitten und von Schrift \u252 \'fcberdeckt, 2. H\u228 \'e4lfte 15. Jh. (nach 1473), enth\u228 \'e4lt: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In festo sancte Katherina de Senis. Capitulum. Us meten tercia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Hanc amavi et exquisiui eam a principio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (Sap 8,2). \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ad sexta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8249 \'8b Cap. Sap 8,3-4. \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ad nona\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8249 \'8b Cap. Sir 11,3. \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Nach vers\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Illumina oculos meos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (Ps 12,4-5). \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De sancta Katherina de Senis. Oratio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8249 \'8b Or. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Deus qui beate Katherine virginitatis et paciencie}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   speciali priuilegio decorare malignancium spirituum certamina vincere et in amore tui nominis inconcusse permanere tribuisti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (Parallelhs.: Basel, UB, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 B IX 28}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 130\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Octav von S Katherina memori zu metten\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8249 \'8b Ant. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Det Katherina frui nos uero lumine Christi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Chev\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . 36637). \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Zu vesper memori\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8249 \'8b Ant. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ad sedes regni faciat transire superni uirgo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Chev\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . 34944). \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De sancto Anthonini episcopi et confessoris oracio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8249 \'8b Or. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Gregem tuum, quesumus domine, pastor eterne, custodi}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   et quem beati presuli Anthonini virginitatis et pietatis prerogatiua specialiter donasti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...}

