\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (134\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  De sancto spiritu\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Guerrini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   Nr. 880. \endash  (138\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  De sancta cruce\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Guerrini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   Nr. 881. \endash  (139\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  In commemoracione beate Marie. In aduentu\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Guerrini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   Nr. 882. \endash  (140\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  A natiuitate domini usque ad purificacionem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Salue sancta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Guerrini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   Nr. 883. \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Ad purificacionem usque ad aduentum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Guerrini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   Nr. 884 mit den Zus\u228 \'e4tzen: (141\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Kyrie; (142\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Gloria in excelsis deo; (143\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Gr R/ \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Benedicta et uenerabilis es uirgo Maria\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (GR [90]f.); (144\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) All V/ \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Uirga Iesse floruit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (GR [88]); (145\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Sanctus; (146\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Agnus dei; (147\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   Ite, missa est. Deo gracias\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  A septuagesima usque ad pascam loco \u8218 \'82Alleiua\u8219 ? dicatur tractus \u8218 \'82Gaudeamus\u8219 ?. Cetera ut supra nisi quid \u8218 \'82Gloria in excelsis\u8219 ? et \u8218 \'82Ite missa\u8219 ? non dicuntur. Tempore resurreccionis primum \u8218 \'82Alleluia\u8219 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , V/ \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Virga\u8249 \'8b, secundus \u8218 \'82Alleluia\u8219 ?,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   V/ \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Surrexit dominus et occur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  [ens]\u8249 \'8b. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Cetera ut supra. Tempore ascensionis primum \u8218 \'82Alleluia\u8219 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , V/ \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Virga\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b, \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  secundus \u8218 \'82Alleluia\u8219 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , V/ \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Ascendens Christus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Cetera ut supra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b Vgl. auch Colmar, BMun, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Ms. 303}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (cat. 254), 138\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . \endash  148\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   leer.}

