\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Tempore paschali\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Kyrie eleyson. Christe eleyson. Kyrie eleyson; Gloria in excelsis deo. Et in terra pax\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ||. Textabbruch. \endash  (149\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Von C\rquote  auf eingef\u252 \'fcgtem Bl.: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Tempore paschale\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Gloria in excelsis deo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (vgl. GR 4*-6*); (149\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Agnus dei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (vgl. GR 6*). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Ite, missa est. Alleluia. Deo gracias. Alleluia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . \endash  (150\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  In festis totum duplicibus et duplicibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b Wie {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Clm 2931}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , 154\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  -160\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . \endash  (152\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  -154\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Credo (vgl. auch GR 55*-57*). \endash  (154\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Sanctus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ; (155\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Agnus dei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ; (155\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Ite, missa est. Deo gracias\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  In festis semiduplicibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \endash  (159\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  In dominicis et festis simplicibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \endash  (162\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  In missis matutinalibus et infra octauas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \endash  (164\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  In festis trium leccionum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \endash  (165\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Quando episcopus celebrat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  In missis defunctorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b.
