\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (166\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  -169\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Conceptio BMV (8.12.): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Concepcio Marie uirginis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (AH 54 Nr. 188). \endash  (169\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  -171\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  In natiuitate domini et duobus diebus sequentibus et in epyphania et purificacione sequencia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Letabundus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   | \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Exultet fidelis chorus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (AH 54 Nr. 2). \endash  (171\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  -174\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Antonius abb. (17.1.): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  In hac die letabunda\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (AH 55 Nr. 69). \endash  (174\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  -176\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Vincentius m. (22.1.): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Letabundus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   | \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Nunc totus decantet mundus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   | \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Dulce melos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (AH 55 Nr. 342). \endash  (176\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  -178\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Thomas de Aquino (7.3.): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Letabundus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   | \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Exultet nunc fratrum chorus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (AH 55 Nr. 325). \endash  (178\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  -180\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Annunciatio BMV (25.3.): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Ave, Maria, gratia plena\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   | \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Dominus tecum, uirgo serena\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (AH 54 Nr. 216). \endash  (181\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  -185\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Vincentius Ferrerius (5.4.): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Gaude, mater ecclesia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (AH 55 Nr. 343). \endash  (185\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  -188\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Petrus Martyr (29.4.): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Adest dies celebris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   | \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Quo lumen tenebris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (AH 55 Nr. 293). \endash  (188\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  -192\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Catharina Senensis (30.4.): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Salue beata Katherina de Senis filia Acosti sic congrue dicta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Chev\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . 17834). \endash  (192\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  -196\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  In utroque festo sancti Michaelis sequencia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Laus erumpat ex affectu\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (AH 55 Nr. 258). \endash  (196\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  -200\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Dominicus cf. fund. OP: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  In celesti ierarchia noua sonet armonia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Chev\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . 27991). \endash  (200\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  -202\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Commemoratio BMV: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Uerbum bonum et suaue\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (AH 54 Nr. 218). \endash  (202\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  -203\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  A natiuitate usque ad purificacionem \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8218 \'82\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Letabundus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8219 ?\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   tempore paschali sequencia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Uirgini Marie laudes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (AH 54 Nr. 21). \endash  (203\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  -205\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Post festum sancte trinitas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (!), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  quando de beata Maria agitur in sabbatis. Sequencia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Hodierne lux diei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   | \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Celebris in matris dei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (AH 54 Nr. 219). \endash  (205\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  -208\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Alia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Aue, mundi spes, Maria\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (AH 54 Nr. 217). \endash  (208\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  -212\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Alia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Iubilemus in hac die\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (AH 54 Nr. 284). \endash  (212\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  -214\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Alia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Tibi cordis in altari\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   |\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22   Decet preces immolari\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (AH 54 Nr. 279). \endash  (214\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  -217\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Alia\u8249 \'8b Stella maris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   | \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  O Maria\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   | \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Expers paris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (AH 54 Nr. 283).}

